#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce.rst:42
msgid ""
"Handle the complete e-commerce order lifecycle, from sales and abandoned "
"carts to delivery, stock management, returns, and invoicing."
msgstr ""
"Håndter hele webshop-ordrens livscyklus fra salg og forladte indkøbskurve "
"til levering, lagerstyring, returneringer og fakturering."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce.rst:49
