#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce.rst:54
msgid ""
"Connect Odoo eCommerce to Google Merchant Center and other platforms, such "
"as TikTok, Facebook, or Instagram to showcase products across multiple "
"channels."
msgstr ""
"Forbind Odoo webshop til Google Merchant Center og andre platforme som "
