#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:-1
msgid ""
"This page describes how to customize order buttons and add-to-cart behavior "
"in Odoo eCommerce, and outlines the checkout steps customers go through, "
"including order summary, address, payment, and order confirmation."
msgstr ""
"Denne side beskriver, hvordan du tilpasser ordreknapper og adfærd for Tilføj "
"til kurv i Odoo eCommerce, og skitserer betalingstrinnene, som kunderne "
"gennemgår, herunder ordreoversigt, adresse, betaling og ordrebekræftelse."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:10
msgid ""
"Odoo eCommerce provides several options to organize the ordering and "
"checkout process. It offers different :ref:`order button <ecommerce/checkout/"
"order-buttons>` options and sequential :ref:`checkout steps <ecommerce/"
"checkout/steps>`, some of which support additional features. The related "
"buttons and checkout pages can be customized using the :doc:`website editor "
"<../website/web_design>`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo Webshop tilbyder flere muligheder for at organisere bestillings- og "
"betalingsprocessen. Den tilbyder forskellige :ref:`ordreknap <ecommerce/"
"checkout/order-buttons>` muligheder og sekventielle :ref:`betalingstrin "
"<ecommerce/checkout/steps>`, hvoraf nogle understøtter yderligere "
"funktioner. De relaterede knapper og betalingssider kan tilpasses ved hjælp "
"af :doc:`hjemmesideredigeringen <../website/web_design>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:19
msgid "Order buttons"
msgstr "Bestillingsknapper"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/checkout.rst:21
