msgid "Customer accounts"
msgstr "Kundekonti"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration.rst:36
msgid ""
"Control access to the shop, the checkout, and the customer portal, and use "
"customer accounts to support B2B and B2C operations."
msgstr ""
"Kontroller adgangen til butikken, betalingen og kundeportalen, og brug "
"kundekonti til at understøtte B2B- og B2C-operationer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration.rst:42
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:3
msgid "B2B and B2C"
msgstr "B2B og B2C"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration.rst:42
msgid ""
"Configure separate websites and shops for B2B and B2C businesses and "
"customize them to meet the specific needs of each business model."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurer separate hjemmesider og butikker til B2B- og B2C-virksomheder, og "
"tilpas dem for at opfylde de specifikke behov i hver forretningsmodel."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo eCommerce is designed to fulfill the needs of both B2B and B2C "
"companies. It allows you to configure :doc:`prices <prices>`, "
"manage :doc:`access <customer_accounts>` for specific customers, "
"and :ref:`customize the website <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/multiple-websites>` to "
"support B2B, B2C, or both business models."
msgstr ""
"Odoo webshop er designet til at opfylde behovene for både B2B- og B2C-"
"virksomheder. Den giver dig mulighed for at konfigurere :doc:`priser "
"<prices>`, administrere :doc:`adgang <customer_accounts>` for specifikke "
"kunder og :ref:`tilpasse hjemmesiden <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/multiple-websites>` "
"for at understøtte B2B-, B2C- eller begge forretningsmodeller."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:15
msgid ""
"While B2C businesses sell directly to the end consumer with a :ref:`tax-"
"included <ecommerce-price-management-tax-display>` price, B2B businesses "
"usually :ref:`exclude taxes <ecommerce-price-management-tax-display>` and "
"may even prefer to hide prices altogether, showcasing only their products "
"instead. To configure a B2B-specific online shop, make sure the :ref:`Tax-"
"Excluded <ecommerce/prices/taxes>` option is enabled, and complete the "
"configuration to :ref:`hide the pricing <ecommerce/prices/hide-prices>`."
msgstr ""
"Mens B2C-virksomheder sælger direkte til slutforbrugeren med en :ref:`pris "
"inkl. moms <ecommerce-price-management-tax-display>`, :ref:`ekskluderer B2B-"
"virksomheder normalt moms <ecommerce-price-management-tax-display>` og "
"foretrækker måske endda at skjule priser helt og i stedet kun fremvise deres "
"produkter. For at konfigurere en B2B-specifik webshop skal du sikre dig, at "
"indstillingen :ref:`Ekskl. moms <ecommerce/prices/taxes>` er aktiveret, og "
"fuldføre konfigurationen for at :ref:`skjule priserne <ecommerce/prices/hide-"
"prices>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:24
msgid ""
"To make sure that only customers with an :ref:`account and granted access "
"<ecommerce/customer_accounts/account-creation>` can see the prices, go "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> eCommerce --> Customers`, click the :icon:`fa-"
"caret-down` :guilabel:`(dropdown)` icon from the search bar, and select "
"the :guilabel:`Archived` filter. Then click the :guilabel:`Public user` "
"card, go to the :guilabel:`Sales & Purchase` tab, and add the zero-priced "
"pricelist configured to :ref:`cover all countries <ecommerce/prices/country-"
"groups>`. Keep the :guilabel:`Public User` contact :guilabel:`Archived` at "
"all times. Website visitors now see the products without prices, while only "
"customers with an :ref:`account invitation <ecommerce/customer_accounts/"
"account-creation>` and an assigned :ref:`pricelist <ecommerce/prices/"
"pricelists>` can view the pricing in the customer portal."
msgstr ""
"For at sikre at kun kunder med en :ref:`konto og givet adgang <ecommerce/"
"customer_accounts/account-creation>` kan se priserne, gå "
"til :menuselection:`Hjemmeside --> Webshop --> Kunder`, klik på "
"ikonet :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(rullemenu)` fra søgelinjen, og vælg "
"filteret :guilabel:`Arkiveret`. Klik derefter på kortet :guilabel:`Offentlig "
"bruger`, gå til fanen :guilabel:`Salg & Indkøb`, og tilføj prislisten med "
"nulpriser konfigureret til at :ref:`dække alle lande <ecommerce/prices/"
"country-groups>`. Hold kontakten :guilabel:`Offentlig "
"bruger` :guilabel:`Arkiveret` til enhver tid. Hjemmesidebesøgende ser nu "
"produkterne uden priser, mens kun kunder med en :ref:`kontoinvitation "
"<ecommerce/customer_accounts/account-creation>` og en "
"tildelt :ref:`prisliste <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` kan se priserne i "
"kundeportalen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:36
msgid ":doc:`/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/B2B_B2C`"
msgstr ":doc:`/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/B2B_B2C`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:37
msgid ":ref:`Discounts <ecommerce/prices/discounts>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Rabatter <ecommerce/prices/discounts>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:42
msgid "Access request"
msgstr "Adgangsanmodning"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:44
msgid ""
"When running a B2B business, you usually :ref:`hide the pricing <ecommerce/"
"b2b_b2c/prices>` on the web shop and make it available for :ref:`logged-in "
"users <ecommerce/customer_accounts/shop-access>` only. To prevent anyone "
"from signing up freely, set the :ref:`Customer Account <ecommerce/"
"customer_accounts/account-creation>` setting option to :guilabel:`On "
"invitation`. To create a page where customers request access, open "
"the :doc:`website editor </applications/websites/website/"
"web_design>`, :doc:`create a form <../../website/web_design/building_blocks/"
"forms>`, customize it, and in the :guilabel:`Action` field, "
"select :guilabel:`Create a customer`."
msgstr ""
"Når du driver en B2B-virksomhed, vil du typisk :ref:`skjule priserne "
"<ecommerce/b2b_b2c/prices>` i webshoppen og kun gøre dem tilgængelige for "
":ref:`indloggede brugere <ecommerce/customer_accounts/shop-access>`. For at "
"forhindre fri oprettelse skal du angive indstillingen :ref:`Kundekonto "
"<ecommerce/customer_accounts/account-creation>` til :guilabel:`Efter "
"invitation`. For at oprette en side, hvor kunder anmoder om adgang, skal du "
"åbne :doc:`hjemmesideredigeringsprogrammet </applications/websites/website/"
"web_design>`, :doc:`oprette en formular <../../website/web_design/"
"building_blocks/forms>`, tilpasse den og i feltet :guilabel:`Handling` vælge "
":guilabel:`Opret en kunde`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:54
msgid ""
"You can assign tags created on a contact form under :menuselection:`Website "
"--> Configuration --> Customers` to identify what kind of customers have "
"submitted the form. To do so, open the :doc:`website editor </applications/"
"websites/website/web_design>` and select a field in the form. Then, in "
"the :guilabel:`Style` tab, click the :guilabel:`+ Field` button in "
"the :guilabel:`Field` section heading and set the field's :guilabel:`Type` "
"to :guilabel:`Tags`. Toggle the tags that should be automatically assigned "
"when a customer fills in the form and set the field's :guilabel:`Visibility "
"Rule` to :guilabel:`Hidden`."
msgstr ""
"Du kan tildele tags oprettet på en kontaktformular under "
":menuselection:`Websted --> Konfiguration --> Kunder` for at identificere, "
"hvilken type kunder der har indsendt formularen. For at gøre dette skal du "
"åbne :doc:`webstedseditoren </applications/websites/website/web_design>` og "
"vælge et felt i formularen. Derefter, under fanen :guilabel:`Stil`, skal du "
"klikke på knappen :guilabel:`+ Felt` i sektionsoverskriften :guilabel:`Felt` "
"og indstille feltets :guilabel:`Type` til :guilabel:`Tags`. Tilkobl de tags, "
"der automatisk skal tildeles, når en kunde udfylder formularen, og indstil "
"feltets :guilabel:`Synlighedsregel` til :guilabel:`Skjult`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:62
msgid ""
"When a customer submits the form, a new contact is automatically created in "
"the database. The contact is assigned the first pricelist from the list of "
"available pricelists, and, if applicable, the specified tags."
msgstr ""
"Når en kunde indsender formularen, oprettes en ny kontakt automatisk i "
"databasen. Kontakten får tildelt den første prisliste fra listen over "
"tilgængelige prislister og, hvis relevant, de angivne tags."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:66
msgid ""
"Submitted requests can be found under the :menuselection:`Website --> "
"eCommerce --> Customers`. Select the customer you want to :ref:`grant portal "
"access <ecommerce/customer_accounts/grant-access>` to. Once done, the "
"selected customer is able to view the B2B prices and products. Make sure the "
"correct pricelist is assigned to their contact form."
msgstr ""
"Indsendte anmodninger kan findes under :menuselection:`Hjemmeside --> "
"Webshop --> Kunder`. Vælg den kunde, du vil :ref:`give portaladgang "
"<ecommerce/customer_accounts/grant-access>` til. Når det er gjort, kan den "
"valgte kunde se B2B-priserne og produkterne. Sørg for at den korrekte "
"prisliste er tildelt deres kontaktformular."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:73
msgid ""
"It is also possible to hide the entire shop from the public using "
"the :ref:`Ecommerce Access <ecommerce/customer_accounts/shop-access>` "
"setting and only make it available for logged-in customers."
msgstr ""
"Det er også muligt at skjule hele shoppen for offentligheden ved hjælp af "
"indstillingen :ref:`Webshop-adgang <ecommerce/customer_accounts/shop-"
"access>` og kun gøre den tilgængelig for loggede kunder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:76
msgid ""
"Configure the :ref:`checkout policy <ecommerce/customer_accounts/checkout-"
"access>` to allow/disallow guest checkout for B2C businesses."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurér :ref:`betalingspolitikken <ecommerce/customer_accounts/checkout-"
"access>` for at tillade/nægte gæstebetaling for B2C-virksomheder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:78
msgid ""
"Enable the :ref:`Shared Customer Accounts <ecommerce/customer_accounts/"
"multiple-websites>` feature to allow customers to use the same account "
"on :ref:`all <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/multiple-websites>` your websites."
msgstr ""
"Aktivér funktionen :ref:`Delte kundekonti <ecommerce/customer_accounts/"
"multiple-websites>` for at tillade kunder at bruge den samme konto "
"på :ref:`alle <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/multiple-websites>` dine hjemmesider."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:83
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:351
msgid ":doc:`customer_accounts`"
msgstr ":doc:`customer_accounts`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:88
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:3
msgid "Multiple websites"
msgstr "Flere hjemmesider"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:90
msgid ""
"Settings are website-specific, which means it is possible to configure "
"different behaviors for each website. For example, you can set up a B2C "
"website that allows :ref:`guest checkout <ecommerce/customer_accounts/"
"checkout-access>` and displays :ref:`tax-included prices <ecommerce-price-"
"management-tax-display>`, and a B2B website that requires :ref:`sign-in "
"<ecommerce/customer_accounts/checkout-access>` and shows :ref:`tax-excluded "
"prices <ecommerce-price-management-tax-display>`. However, "
"each :ref:`pricelist <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` can only be assigned to "
"one website at a time. If you want to use the same pricelist on several "
"websites, duplicate the pricelist and assign each copy to its corresponding "
"website."
msgstr ""
"Indstillinger er hjemmesidespecifikke, hvilket betyder, at det er muligt at "
"konfigurere forskellige adfærdsmønstre for hver hjemmeside. Du kan for "
"eksempel opsætte en B2C-hjemmeside, der tillader :ref:`gæstebetaling "
"<ecommerce/customer_accounts/checkout-access>` og viser :ref:`priser "
"inklusiv moms <ecommerce-price-management-tax-display>`, og en B2B-"
"hjemmeside, der kræver :ref:`login <ecommerce/customer_accounts/checkout-"
"access>` og viser :ref:`priser eksklusiv moms <ecommerce-price-management-"
"tax-display>`. Dog kan hver :ref:`prisliste <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` "
"kun tildeles én hjemmeside ad gangen. Hvis du vil bruge den samme prisliste "
"på flere hjemmesider, skal du duplikere prislisten og tildele hver kopi til "
"dens tilsvarende hjemmeside."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:101
msgid ""
"If you are running a B2B and B2C business, we *strongly* recommend to create "
"two :doc:`separate websites </applications/websites/website/configuration/"
"multi_website>` and assign a :ref:`zero-priced pricelist <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/"
"prices>` to the B2B website and a regular pricelist to the B2C website. In "
"case, you prefer using a single website, configure it using :ref:`country "
"groups <ecommerce/prices/country-groups>` and assigning :ref:`pricelists "
"<ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` to customers, and deactivate "
"the :ref:`Selectable <ecommerce/prices/selectable-pricelists>` option."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du driver både B2B- og B2C-forretning, anbefaler vi *kraftigt*, at du "
"opretter to :doc:`separate hjemmesider </applications/websites/website/"
"configuration/multi_website>` og tildeler en :ref:`prisliste med nulpris "
"<ecommerce/b2b_b2c/prices>` til B2B-hjemmesiden og en almindelig prisliste "
"til B2C-hjemmesiden. Hvis du foretrækker at bruge en enkelt hjemmeside, skal "
"du konfigurere den ved hjælp af :ref:`landegrupper <ecommerce/prices/country-"
"groups>` og tildele :ref:`prislister <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` til "
"kunder samt deaktivere indstillingen :ref:`Valgbar <ecommerce/prices/"
"selectable-pricelists>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:113
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design.rst:30
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:3
msgid "Additional features"
msgstr "Yderligere funktioner"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:118
msgid "Invoice"
msgstr "Faktura"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:120
msgid ""
"Depending on the type of business (B2B or B2C), you might want to issue an "
"invoice. An invoice can either be generated automatically (for B2B) or on "
"demand of the customer (for B2C). This process can be automated if (and "
"when) the online payment is :ref:`confirmed <ecommerce/handling/sales>`. To "
"automate invoicing, enable the :ref:`Automatic Invoice <ecommerce/handling/"
"invoices>` setting. If this feature has not been enabled, the customer only "
"receives an order confirmation."
msgstr ""
"Afhængigt af forretningstypen (B2B eller B2C) vil du måske udstede en "
"faktura. En faktura kan enten genereres automatisk (til B2B) eller efter "
"kundens anmodning (til B2C). Denne proces kan automatiseres, hvis (og når) "
"onlinebetalingen er :ref:`bekræftet <ecommerce/handling/sales>`. For at "
"automatisere fakturering skal du aktivere indstillingen :ref:`Automatisk "
"faktura <ecommerce/handling/invoices>`. Hvis denne funktion ikke er "
"aktiveret, modtager kunden kun en ordrebekræftelse."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:127
msgid ""
"The :ref:`Pay on Invoice <ecommerce/payments/pay-on-invoice>` payment method "
"allows customers to place an order without upfront payment and pay after "
"they receive the invoice."
msgstr ""
"Betalingsmetoden :ref:`Betal ved faktura <ecommerce/payments/pay-on-invoice>"
"` gør det muligt for kunder at afgive en ordre uden forudbetaling og betale, "
"efter de har modtaget fakturaen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:133
msgid "B2B fields at checkout"
msgstr "B2B-felter ved betaling"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/b2b_b2c.rst:135
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Order summary` page, open the :doc:`website editor </"
"applications/websites/website/web_design>`, go to the :guilabel:`Style` tab, "
"and toggle the :guilabel:`Show B2B Fields` switch to display B2B-specific "
"additional fields like :guilabel:`VAT` or :guilabel:`Company Name` during "
"the :ref:`delivery <ecommerce/checkout/delivery>` step."
msgstr ""
"På siden :guilabel:`Ordreoversigt` skal du "
"åbne :doc:`hjemmesideredigeringsværktøjet </applications/websites/website/"
"web_design>`, gå til fanen :guilabel:`Typografi`, og slå "
"kontakten :guilabel:`Vis B2B-felter` til for at vise B2B-specifikke ekstra "
"felter som :guilabel:`Moms` eller :guilabel:`Firmanavn` "
"under :ref:`leveringstrinnet <ecommerce/checkout/delivery>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo eCommerce provides multiple ways to configure, :doc:`present <../../"
"ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog>`, and sell different product options to "
"customers while organizing products by category for a better overview and "
"smoother navigation."
msgstr ""
"Odoo Webshop tilbyder flere måder at konfigurere, :doc:`præsentere <../../"
"ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog>` og sælge forskellige produktmuligheder "
"til kunder, samtidig med at produkter organiseres efter kategori for bedre "
"overblik og mere smidig navigation."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:12
msgid "Product variants"
msgstr "Produktvarianter"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:14
msgid ""
":doc:`Product variants </applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/"
"variants>` are different versions of the same product, created by "
"combining :ref:`attributes <products/variants/attributes>` like color, size, "
"material, etc., which can lead to differences in price and/or availability."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Produktvarianter </applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/"
"variants>` er forskellige versioner af samme produkt, oprettet ved at "
"kombinere :ref:`attributter <products/variants/attributes>` som farve, "
"størrelse, materiale osv., hvilket kan føre til forskelle i pris og/eller "
"tilgængelighed."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:18
msgid "To configure product variants for a product:"
msgstr "Sådan konfigureres produktvarianter for et produkt:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:20
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:54
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:100
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:129
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:252
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/shipping.rst:33
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/shipping.rst:112
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:80
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/translate.rst:16
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings`."
msgstr ""
"Gå til :menuselection:`Hjemmeside --> Konfiguration --> Indstillinger`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:21
msgid ""
"Scroll down to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` section and enable "
"the :guilabel:`Product Variants` feature."
msgstr ""
"Rul ned til sektionen :guilabel:`Webshop` og aktivér "
"funktionen :guilabel:`Produktvarianter`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:23
msgid ""
"Access the :ref:`product form <ecommerce/products/product-form>` and go to "
"the :guilabel:`Attributes & Variants` tab."
msgstr ""
"Åbn :ref:`produktformularen <ecommerce/products/product-form>` og gå til "
"fanen :guilabel:`Attributter og varianter`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:25
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Add a line` and select the relevant attribute and its "
"values. Repeat this step for each additional attribute."
msgstr ""
"Klik på :guilabel:`Tilføj en linje` og vælg den relevante attribut og dens "
"værdier. Gentag dette trin for hver ekstra attribut."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:28
msgid ""
"The product variants are created automatically (or not) based on "
"the :ref:`attribute's configuration <products/variants/attributes>`."
msgstr ""
"Produktvarianterne oprettes automatisk (eller ej) baseret "
"på :ref:`attributtens konfiguration <products/variants/attributes>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:32
msgid ":doc:`/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants`"
msgstr ":doc:`/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/products/variants`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:37
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:98
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:100
msgid "Attributes"
msgstr "Attributter"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:39
msgid ""
"Attributes refer to the characteristics of a product, such as its color or "
"material. Each attribute includes a set of values."
msgstr ""
"Attributter refererer til et produkts karakteristika, såsom dets farve eller "
"materiale. Hver attribut omfatter et sæt værdier."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:42
msgid "Attributes and variants of your product"
msgstr "Attributter og varianter for dit produkt"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:45
msgid ""
"Once your attributes are :ref:`created <products/variants/attributes>`, "
"navigate to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` tab of the attribute form and "
"configure the following options to control where and/or how they appear on "
"the website:"
msgstr ""
"Når dine attributter er :ref:`oprettet <products/variants/attributes>`, skal "
"du navigere til fanen :guilabel:`e-handel` på attributformularen og "
"konfigurere følgende indstillinger for at styre, hvor og/eller hvordan de "
"vises på webstedet:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:49
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Filter`: Set the field to :guilabel:`Visible` to make the "
"attribute available in the shop's filter section."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Filter`: Sæt feltet til :guilabel:`Synlig` for at gøre "
"attributten tilgængelig i butikkens filtersektion."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/categories_variants.rst:51
msgid ""
":guilabel:`On Product Cards`: Set the field to :guilabel:`Visible` "
"or :guilabel:`Hover` to display attributes on the product card on the shop "
"page. These options are only available when :ref:`variants are created "
"instantly for the attribute <products/variants/attributes>`. "
