#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:81
msgid "Pricelists"
msgstr "Prislister"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:83
msgid ""
"Pricelists in Odoo allow for managing flexible pricing rules and offering "
"different prices and discounts based on currencies, time periods, purchase "
"volumes, :ref:`customers' location <ecommerce/prices/geoip>`, and/or "
"customer type."
msgstr ""
"Prislister i Odoo gør det muligt at administrere fleksible prisregler og "
"tilbyde forskellige priser og rabatter baseret på valutaer, tidsperioder, "
"købsmængder, :ref:`kundernes placering <ecommerce/prices/geoip>` og/eller "
"kundetype."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:87
msgid ""
"To enable pricelists for eCommerce, go to :menuselection:`Website --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` "
"section, enable :guilabel:`Pricelists`, and :guilabel:`Save`. Then, "
"click :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Pricelists` or go "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> eCommerce --> Pricelists` and :ref:`configure "
"<sales/products/pricelist-configuration>` the relevant pricelists."
msgstr ""
"For at aktivere prislister til e-handel skal du gå "
"til :menuselection:`Hjemmeside --> Konfiguration --> Indstillinger`, rulle "
"ned til sektionen :guilabel:`Webshop`, aktivere :guilabel:`Prislister` og "
"klikke på :guilabel:`Gem`. Klik derefter på :icon:`fa-arrow-"
"right` :guilabel:`Prislister`, eller gå til :menuselection:`Hjemmeside --> "
"Webshop --> Prislister` og :ref:`konfigurer <sales/products/pricelist-"
"configuration>` de relevante prislister."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:93
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Ecommerce` tab, configure options specific to online "
"sales, such as assigning a :guilabel:`Website` to a pricelist, allowing "
"customers to :ref:`select it <ecommerce/prices/selectable-pricelists>`, and/"
"or adding an :ref:`E-commerce Promotional Code <ecommerce/prices/promotional-"
"code>`."
msgstr ""
"I fanen :guilabel:`Ecommerce` skal du konfigurere indstillinger, der er "
"specifikke for onlinesalg, såsom at tildele en :guilabel:`Hjemmeside` til en "
"prisliste, give kunder mulighed for at :ref:`vælge den <ecommerce/prices/"
"selectable-pricelists>` og/eller tilføje en :ref:`Webshop-kampagnekode "
"<ecommerce/prices/promotional-code>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:99
msgid ""
"If you are using several websites and want to use the same pricelist on "
"several of them, you need to duplicate the pricelist for each website. If "
"you do not assign any website, the pricelist will not be used, unless it "
"is :ref:`selectable <ecommerce/prices/selectable-pricelists>`."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du bruger flere hjemmesider, og du vil bruge samme prisliste på flere "
"af dem, skal du duplikere prislisten for hver hjemmeside. Hvis du ikke "
"tildeler nogen hjemmeside, bruges prislisten ikke, medmindre den "
"er :ref:`valgbar <ecommerce/prices/selectable-pricelists>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:103
msgid ""
"Pricelists can also be :ref:`assigned to a specific customer <sales/pricing/"
"customer-pricelist-application>`."
msgstr ""
"Prislister kan også :ref:`tildeles en specifik kunde <sales/pricing/customer-"
"pricelist-application>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:107
msgid ""
"When pricelists are enabled in the Sales app, they are automatically enabled "
"in the eCommerce app, and vice versa."
msgstr ""
"Når prislister er aktiveret i Salg-appen, aktiveres de automatisk i Webshop-"
"appen og omvendt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:109
msgid ""
"In the list of pricelists, order the pricelists by priority: the first takes "
"precedence over the second, the second over the third, and so on."
msgstr ""
"I listen over prislister skal du sortere prislisterne efter prioritet: den "
"første har forrang for den anden, den anden for den tredje, og så videre."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:111
msgid ""
"It is also possible to create specific pricelists for :ref:`variants "
"<products/variants/configure-variants>`."
msgstr ""
"Det er også muligt at oprette specifikke prislister for :ref:`varianter "
"<products/variants/configure-variants>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:115
msgid ":doc:`/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing`"
msgstr ":doc:`/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:120
msgid "Selectable pricelists"
msgstr "Valgbare prislister"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:122
msgid ""
"Selectable pricelists are useful, for example, when selling products "
"in :doc:`multiple currencies <../../../sales/sales/products_prices/prices/"
"currencies>`, and allow customers to choose a pricelist using the pricelist "
"selector in the catalog, located next to the :ref:`search bar <ecommerce/"
"catalog/toolbar-and-filters>`."
msgstr ""
"Valgbare prislister er f.eks. nyttige, når der sælges produkter "
"i :doc:`flere valutaer <../../../sales/sales/products_prices/prices/"
"currencies>`, og de giver kunder mulighed for at vælge en prisliste ved "
"hjælp af prislistevælgeren i kataloget, som er placeret ved siden "
"af :ref:`søgelinjen <ecommerce/catalog/toolbar-and-filters>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:127
msgid "Pricelist selector on the e-commerce."
msgstr "Prislistevælger på webshoppen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:130
msgid "To make a pricelist selectable, enable :guilabel:`Selectable`."
msgstr "For at gøre en prisliste valgbar skal du aktivere :guilabel:`Valgbar`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:133
msgid ""
"If a pricelist is designated as :guilabel:`Selectable` and not assigned to a "
"specific website, it is selectable on **all** websites."
msgstr ""
"Hvis en prisliste er angivet som :guilabel:`Valgbar` og ikke er tildelt et "
"bestemt websted, kan den vælges på **alle** websteder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:135
msgid ""
"If a pricelist does *not* appear in the selector, it may be due to the "
"following situations:"
msgstr ""
"Hvis en prisliste *ikke* vises i vælgeren, kan det skyldes følgende "
"situationer:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:137
msgid ""
"Only one pricelist is defined as :guilabel:`Selectable`, and "
"the :ref:`contact has a pricelist assigned <sales/pricing/customer-pricelist-"
"application>`."
msgstr ""
"Kun én prisliste er defineret som :guilabel:`Valgbar`, og :ref:`kontakten "
"har fået tildelt en prisliste <sales/pricing/customer-pricelist-"
"application>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:139
msgid ""
"Multiple selectable pricelists exist, but only those matching the "
"customer's :ref:`country group <ecommerce/prices/country-groups>` are shown. "
"It is strongly recommended to disable the :guilabel:`Selectable` option when "
"using pricelists with country groups on the e-commerce."
msgstr ""
"Der findes flere valgbare prislister, men kun dem, der matcher "
"kundens :ref:`landegruppe <ecommerce/prices/country-groups>`, vises. Det "
"anbefales stærkt at deaktivere indstillingen :guilabel:`Valgbar`, når du "
"bruger prislister med landegrupper på webshoppen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:145
msgid ":ref:`sales/products/currencies/currency-specific-pricelists`"
msgstr ":ref:`sales/products/currencies/currency-specific-pricelists`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:150
msgid "GeoIP & country groups"
msgstr "GeoIP og landegrupper"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:152
msgid ""
"It is possible to display a specific pricelist based on the visitor's "
"location and IP address by assigning :ref:`country groups <ecommerce/prices/"
"country-groups>` to pricelists."
msgstr ""
"Det er muligt at vise en specifik prisliste baseret på besøgendes placering "
"og IP-adresse ved at tildele :ref:`landegrupper <ecommerce/prices/country-"
"groups>` til prislister."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:157
msgid ""
"To do so, :ref:`navigate to the relevant pricelist form <ecommerce/prices/"
"pricelists>` and select the appropriate :guilabel:`Country Groups`. Create "
"or edit as many pricelists for specific regions as needed. For instance, "
"select :guilabel:`European Union` to apply the pricelist to all EU member "
"states."
msgstr ""
"For at gøre dette skal du :ref:`navigere til den relevante prislisteformular "
"<ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` og vælge de "
"passende :guilabel:`Landegrupper`. Opret eller rediger så mange prislister "
"for specifikke regioner som nødvendigt. Vælg f.eks. :guilabel:`Den "
"Europæiske Union` for at anvende prislisten på alle EU-medlemslande."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:162
msgid ""
"To create a new country group, click :guilabel:`Search more` in the drop-"
"down list, then :guilabel:`Create New`. Add a :guilabel:`Group Name` and "
"select the relevant :guilabel:`Countries`. Use :ref:`Custom filters <search/"
"custom-filters>` if needed."
msgstr ""
"For at oprette en ny landegruppe skal du klikke på :guilabel:`Søg mere` i "
"rullelisten og derefter på :guilabel:`Opret ny`. Tilføj "
"et :guilabel:`Gruppenavn`, og vælg de relevante :guilabel:`Lande`. "
"Brug :ref:`Brugerdefinerede filtre <search/custom-filters>` efter behov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:167
msgid "Each country group must contain at least one country."
msgstr "Hver landegruppe skal indeholde mindst ét land."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:170
msgid ""
"Use the following filter to add all non-EU countries to the country group."
msgstr ""
"Brug følgende filter til at tilføje alle ikke-EU-lande til landegruppen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:172
msgid "`Country Groups` + `is not equal to` + `European Union`"
msgstr "`Landegrupper` + `er ikke lig med` + `Den Europæiske Union`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:174
msgid "Filter for country group creation."
msgstr "Filter til oprettelse af landegruppe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:178
msgid ""
"When using GeoIP to determine the appropriate pricelist, **all** pricelists "
"used on the e-commerce site must have a country group assigned."
msgstr ""
"Når GeoIP bruges til at bestemme den passende prisliste, skal **alle** "
"prislister, der anvendes på e-handelswebstedet, have tildelt en landegruppe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:180
msgid ""
"It is strongly recommended to disable the :guilabel:`Selectable` option when "
"using pricelists with country groups. Indeed, all pricelists with the "
"relevant country group are automatically applied to the catalog, but if one "
"of them is marked as :ref:`Selectable <ecommerce/prices/selectable-"
"pricelists>`, the others will disappear as soon as customers select the "
"selectable pricelist."
msgstr ""
"Det anbefales stærkt at deaktivere :guilabel:`Valgbar`-indstillingen, når du "
"bruger prislister med landegrupper. Alle prislister med den relevante "
"landegruppe anvendes nemlig automatisk på kataloget, men hvis en af dem er "
"markeret som :ref:`Valgbar <ecommerce/prices/selectable-pricelists>`, vil de "
"andre forsvinde, så snart kunder vælger den valgbare prisliste."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:187
msgid "Imagine you create three pricelists:"
msgstr "Forestil dig, at du opretter tre prislister:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:189
msgid "`EU regular prices` with the `EU` country group assigned"
msgstr "`EU almindelige priser` med landegruppen `EU` tildelt"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:190
msgid "`EU prices with discounts` with the `EU` country group assigned"
msgstr "`EU-priser med rabatter` med landegruppen `EU` tildelt"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:191
msgid "`US prices` with the `US` country group assigned"
msgstr "`US-priser` med landegruppen `US` tildelt"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:193
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Selectable` option is enabled for `EU regular prices` and "
"`US prices`, and the customer is from the European Union, only the "
"pricelists `EU regular prices` and `EU prices with discounts` will be "
"available. However, since the `EU prices with discount` list is not "
"selectable, it will disappear once the customer selects the `EU regular "
"prices` list, and prices will be displayed based on the `EU regular prices` "
"pricelist in the catalog."
msgstr ""
"Hvis :guilabel:`Valgbar`-indstillingen er aktiveret for `EU almindelige "
"priser` og `US-priser`, og kunden er fra Den Europæiske Union, vil kun "
"prislisterne `EU almindelige priser` og `EU-priser med rabatter` være "
"tilgængelige. Men da listen `EU-priser med rabatter` ikke er valgbar, vil "
"den forsvinde, når kunden vælger listen `EU almindelige priser`, og priser "
"vises baseret på prislisten `EU almindelige priser` i kataloget."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:200
msgid "Pricelist application"
msgstr "Anvendelse af prisliste"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:202
msgid ""
"On the e-commerce, the *default* pricelist is automatically selected for "
"public, non-logged-in users when no country group is assigned. "
"If :ref:`GeoIP and country groups <ecommerce/prices/geoip>` are used, public "
"users see the pricelist of their country group by default."
msgstr ""
"På e-handelswebstedet vælges *standardprislisten* automatisk for offentlige, "
"ikke-indloggede brugere, når der ikke er tildelt en landegruppe. "
"Hvis :ref:`GeoIP og landegrupper <ecommerce/prices/geoip>` anvendes, ser "
"offentlige brugere som standard prislisten for deres landegruppe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:206
msgid ""
":ref:`Logged-in users <ecommerce/customer_accounts/shop-access>` "
"with :ref:`assigned pricelists <sales/pricing/customer-pricelist-"
"application>` see the assigned pricelist by default **if it is assigned to "
"the website** they are visiting. If not, the website's default pricelist is "
"applied (i.e., the first available pricelist assigned to the website and "
"without a country group, following the sequence order)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Indloggede brugere <ecommerce/customer_accounts/shop-access>` "
"med :ref:`tildelte prislister <sales/pricing/customer-pricelist-"
"application>` ser som standard den tildelte prisliste, **hvis den er tildelt "
"det websted**, de besøger. Hvis ikke, anvendes webstedets standardprisliste "
"(dvs. den første tilgængelige prisliste, der er tildelt webstedet og uden en "
"landegruppe, i henhold til rækkefølgen)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:212
msgid ""
"Assigned pricelists take precedence over country-based pricelists, when "
"applicable, unless the assigned pricelist is linked to a different country "
"group."
msgstr ""
"Tildelte prislister har forrang frem for landebaserede prislister, når det "
"er relevant, medmindre den tildelte prisliste er knyttet til en anden "
"landegruppe."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:216
msgid ""
"A customer from the United States visits the website. They do not have a "
"portal account. The :guilabel:`United States` pricelist is applied."
msgstr ""
"En kunde fra USA besøger hjemmesiden. De har ikke en "
"portalkonto. :guilabel:`United States` prislisten anvendes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:219
msgid ""
"A different visitor, also from the United States, has the :guilabel:`Loyal "
"Customer Discount` pricelist assigned in their contact form. This assignment "
"takes precedence over the country group assignment, so the :guilabel:`Loyal "
"Customer Discount` is applied."
msgstr ""
"En anden besøgende, også fra USA, har fået tildelt "
"prislisten :guilabel:`Rabat til loyale kunder` i sin kontaktformular. Denne "
"tildeling har forrang over landegruppetildelingen, så :guilabel:`Rabat til "
"loyale kunder` anvendes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:223
msgid "An example of various pricelists assigned to a website."
msgstr "Et eksempel på forskellige prislister tildelt en hjemmeside."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:230
msgid "Discounts"
msgstr "Rabatter"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:235
msgid "Discounts programs"
msgstr "Rabatprogrammer"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:237
msgid ""
"To enable :doc:`discount programs </applications/sales/sales/products_prices/"
"loyalty_discount>` for your e-commerce, go to :menuselection:`Website --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` "
"section, and enable the :guilabel:`Discounts, Loyalty & Gift Card` feature."
msgstr ""
"For at aktivere :doc:`rabatprogrammer </applications/sales/sales/"
"products_prices/loyalty_discount>` til din webshop skal du gå "
"til :menuselection:`Hjemmeside --> Konfiguration --> Indstillinger`, rulle "
"ned til sektionen :guilabel:`Webshop` og aktivere "
"funktionen :guilabel:`Rabatter, loyalitet og gavekort`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:241
msgid ""
":ref:`Configure <sales/loyalty_discount/configure-programs>` the discount "
"program, make sure the :guilabel:`Website` option is enabled, and add the "
"relevant :ref:`Pricelist <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` "
"and :guilabel:`Website` on the program form, if needed."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Konfigurer <sales/loyalty_discount/configure-programs>` "
"rabatprogrammet, sørg for, at indstillingen :guilabel:`Websted` er "
"aktiveret, og tilføj den relevante :ref:`Prisliste <ecommerce/prices/"
"pricelists>` og det relevante :guilabel:`Websted` på programformularen efter "
"behov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:248
msgid "Permanent product discount"
msgstr "Permanent produktrabat"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:250
msgid ""
"When the price of a specific product is permanently reduced, the "
"strikethrough strategy is commonly used. This involves showing the new "
"discounted price, with the original price crossed out alongside it."
msgstr ""
"Når prisen på et specifikt produkt nedsættes permanent, anvendes "
"overstregningsstrategien ofte. Dette indebærer, at den nye nedsatte pris "
"vises, mens den oprindelige pris er streget over ved siden af."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:254
msgid "Price strikethrough."
msgstr "Gennemstreget pris."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:257
msgid ""
"To display a permanently discounted price, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings`, scroll down to "
"the :guilabel:`eCommerce` section, enable the :guilabel:`Comparison Price` "
"option, and :guilabel:`Save`. Then :ref:`go to the product form <ecommerce/"
"products/product-creation>`, enter the new (discounted) price in "
"the :guilabel:`Sales Price` field, and the original price (strikethrough) in "
"the :guilabel:`Compare to Price` field."
msgstr ""
"For at vise en permanent nedsat pris skal du navigere "
"til :menuselection:`Hjemmeside --> Konfiguration --> Indstillinger`, rulle "
"ned til :guilabel:`Webshop`, aktivere indstillingen :guilabel:`Sammenlign "
"pris` og klikke på :guilabel:`Gem`. Derefter skal du :ref:`gå til "
"produktformularen <ecommerce/products/product-creation>`, indtaste den nye "
"(nedsatte) pris i feltet :guilabel:`Salgspris` og den originale pris "
"(overstreget) i feltet :guilabel:`Sammenlign med pris`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:264
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Compare to Price` field must contain a price that is higher "
"than the :guilabel:`Sales Price` for the original price to appear with a "
"strikethrough."
msgstr ""
"Feltet :guilabel:`Sammenlign med pris` skal indeholde en pris, der er højere "
"end :guilabel:`Salgspris`, for at den oprindelige pris kan vises med en "
"gennemstregning."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:268
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Compare to Price` is not displayed if discounted pricelists "
"apply. If you want to use the :guilabel:`Compare to price` with another "
"discount, configure a pricelist with a :ref:`promotional code <ecommerce/"
"prices/promotional-code>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Sammenlign med pris` vises ikke, hvis nedsatte prislister gælder. "
"Hvis du vil bruge :guilabel:`Sammenlign med pris` sammen med en anden rabat, "
"skal du konfigurere en prisliste med en :ref:`kampagnekode <ecommerce/prices/"
"promotional-code>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:273
msgid "Discounted pricelists"
msgstr "Nedsatte prislister"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:275
msgid ""
"It is also possible to create :ref:`pricelists with discounts <sales/"
"products/price-rules>`. To do so, :ref:`create a pricelist <sales/products/"
"pricelist-configuration>` and :ref:`configure the discount <sales/products/"
"price-rules>`."
msgstr ""
"Det er også muligt at oprette :ref:`prislister med rabatter <sales/products/"
"price-rules>`. For at gøre dette skal du :ref:`oprette en prisliste <sales/"
"products/pricelist-configuration>` og :ref:`konfigurere rabatten <sales/"
"products/price-rules>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:279
msgid ""
"If a :ref:`pricelist <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` contains "
"a :ref:`Discount <sales/products/price-rules>` price type, the price is "
"striked through for applicable customers, even if the :ref:`Comparison Price "
"<ecommerce/prices/permanent-discounts>` feature has not been enabled."
msgstr ""
"Hvis en :ref:`prisliste <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` indeholder "
"en :ref:`Rabat <sales/products/price-rules>`-pristype, bliver prisen "
"overstreget for relevante kunder, selvom funktionen :ref:`Sammenligningspris "
"<ecommerce/prices/permanent-discounts>` ikke er blevet aktiveret."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:285
msgid ""
"If using pricelists with :ref:`country groups <ecommerce/prices/geoip>`, the "
"discounted pricelist must be assigned the same country group as the non-"
"discounted pricelist."
msgstr ""
"Hvis der anvendes prislister med :ref:`landegrupper <ecommerce/prices/"
"geoip>`, skal den nedsatte prisliste tildeles den samme landegruppe som den "
"ikke-nedsatte prisliste."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:291
msgid "E-commerce promotional code"
msgstr "Kampagnekode til webshop"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:293
msgid ""
"To offer a discounted pricelist for customers with a specific discount code, "
"access the relevant :ref:`pricelist form <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>`, go "
"to the :guilabel:`Ecommerce` tab, and add an :guilabel:`E-commerce "
"Promotional Code`, e.g., `SUMMERSALE10%`."
msgstr ""
"For at tilbyde en nedsat prisliste til kunder med en bestemt rabatkode skal "
"du åbne den relevante :ref:`prislisteformular <ecommerce/prices/"
"pricelists>`, gå til fanen :guilabel:`E-handel` og tilføje "
"en :guilabel:`Kampagnekode til e-handel`, f.eks. `SUMMERSALE10%`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:297
msgid ""
"Then, go to the :guilabel:`Rules` tab, click :guilabel:`Add a line`, "
"and :ref:`configure the discount <sales/products/price-rules>`. When a "
"customer enters the code during :ref:`checkout <ecommerce/checkout/"
"review_order>`, the discount is applied according to the configuration in "
"the :guilabel:`Rules` tab."
msgstr ""
"Gå derefter til fanen :guilabel:`Regler`, klik på :guilabel:`Tilføj en "
"linje`, og :ref:`konfigurer rabatten <sales/products/price-rules>`. Når en "
"kunde indtaster koden under :ref:`betalingen <ecommerce/checkout/"
"review_order>`, anvendes rabatten i overensstemmelse med konfigurationen "
"under fanen :guilabel:`Regler`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:303
msgid ""
"Make sure that the :ref:`Promo Code <ecommerce/checkout/review_order>` "
"option in the website editor is enabled and, if using :ref:`country groups "
"<ecommerce/prices/country-groups>`, that the discounted pricelist has the "
"same country group assigned as the non-discounted pricelist."
msgstr ""
"Sørg for, at :ref:`Kampagnekode <ecommerce/checkout/review_order>`-"
"indstillingen i hjemmesideeditoren er aktiveret, og hvis du "
"bruger :ref:`landegrupper <ecommerce/prices/country-groups>`, at den "
"nedsatte prisliste har samme landegruppe tildelt som den ikke-nedsatte "
"prisliste."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:310
msgid "Preventing direct sales and hiding prices"
msgstr "Forhindre direkte salg og skjule priser"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:312
msgid ""
"Some businesses, such as :ref:`B2B shops <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/prices>` or "
"companies that sell luxury or custom items, may want to showcase their "
"products online while restricting direct purchases and hiding prices."
msgstr ""
"Nogle virksomheder, såsom :ref:`B2B-butikker <ecommerce/b2b_b2c/prices>` "
"eller virksomheder, der sælger luksus- eller specialfremstillede varer, "
"ønsker måske at fremvise deres produkter online, samtidig med at de "
"begrænser direkte køb og skjuler priser."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:316
msgid ""
"To control price visibility and prevent direct online sales on the e-"
"commerce site, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` section, and "
"enable :guilabel:`Hide Add To Cart`."
msgstr ""
"For at styre synligheden af priser og forhindre direkte onlinesalg på e-"
"handelswebstedet skal du gå til :menuselection:`Websted --> Konfiguration --"
"> Indstillinger`, rulle ned til sektionen :guilabel:`E-handel` og "
"aktivere :guilabel:`Skjul 'Læg i kurv'`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:320
msgid ""
"Then, select one of the following options from the :guilabel:`For` drop-down "
"list to define which products are affected:"
msgstr ""
"Vælg derefter en af følgende muligheder i rullemenuen :guilabel:`For` for at "
"definere, hvilke produkter der berøres:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:323
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`0 price products`: On the :ref:`product form <ecommerce/"
"products/product-creation>`, set the price to `0` for all desired products, "
"or create a :ref:`pricelist <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` where all product "
"prices are set to `0`. The price is then **not** displayed on "
"the :doc:`product page <../ecommerce_design/product_page>`."
msgstr ""
"For :guilabel:`0-prisprodukter`: På :ref:`produktformularen <ecommerce/"
"products/product-creation>` sættes prisen til `0` for alle ønskede "
"produkter, eller der oprettes en :ref:`prisliste <ecommerce/prices/"
"pricelists>`, hvor alle produktpriser er sat til `0`. Prisen vises derefter "
"**ikke** på :doc:`produktsiden <../ecommerce_design/product_page>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:329
msgid ""
"Ensure the pricelist is assigned to the correct website and is listed first "
"among the website's pricelists."
msgstr ""
"Sørg for, at prislisten er tildelt det korrekte website og er angivet først "
"blandt websitets prislister."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:332
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`Specific categories`: Select one or more "
"product :ref:`categories <ecommerce/categories_variants/categories>` from "
"the :guilabel:`Categories` drop-down menu that appears. At least one "
"category **must** be selected. The price is only displayed for products in "
"these categories if it is **not** `0`."
msgstr ""
"For :guilabel:`Specifikke kategorier`: Vælg en eller "
"flere :ref:`produktkategorier <ecommerce/categories_variants/categories>` i "
"den viste rullemenu :guilabel:`Kategorier`. Der **skal** vælges mindst én "
"kategori. Prisen vises kun for produkter i disse kategorier, hvis den "
"**ikke** er `0`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:337
msgid ""
"Then, enter a redirect URL in the :guilabel:`Link URL` field. "
"The :guilabel:`Add to Cart` button on the :doc:`product page <../"
"ecommerce_design/product_page>` for zero-priced products or the selected "
"shop categories is then replaced by a default :guilabel:`Contact us` button, "
"which can be :ref:`customized <ecommerce/checkout/prevent-sale>` if needed."
msgstr ""
"Angiv derefter en omdirigerings-URL i feltet :guilabel:`Link-URL`. "
"Knappen :guilabel:`Læg i kurv` på :doc:`produktsiden <../ecommerce_design/"
"product_page>` for 0-prisprodukter eller de valgte butikskategorier "
"erstattes derefter af en standardknap :guilabel:`Kontakt os`, som "
"kan :ref:`tilpasses <ecommerce/checkout/prevent-sale>` efter behov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:343
msgid ""
"Ensure no pricelist used on the e-commerce has been marked "
"as :guilabel:`Selectable` to prevent accidentally displaying the zero-priced "
"pricelist."
msgstr ""
"Sørg for, at ingen prisliste, der bruges på webshoppen, er markeret "
"som :guilabel:`Valgbar` for at undgå ved et uheld at vise prislisten med "
"nulpris."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/prices.rst:345
msgid ""
"To hide prices from public visitors while keeping them visible to logged-in "
"customers, create a zero-priced pricelist for non-logged-in customers "
"and :ref:`assign <sales/pricing/customer-pricelist-application>` a regular "
"pricelist (with actual prices) to customers with :doc:`portal access "
"<../../../general/users/user_portals/portal_access>`."
msgstr ""
"For at skjule priser for offentlige besøgende og samtidig holde dem synlige "
"for loggede kunder skal du oprette en 0-prisprisliste for ikke-loggede "
"kunder og :ref:`tildele <sales/pricing/customer-pricelist-application>` en "
"almindelig prisliste (med faktiske priser) til kunder med :doc:`portaladgang "
"<../../../general/users/user_portals/portal_access>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo eCommerce allows you to :ref:`create products <ecommerce/products/"
"product-creation>` and manage their :ref:`visibility <ecommerce/products/"
"publish-products>` on the website. Products can be :ref:`configured "
"<ecommerce/products/product-configuration>` in various ways, including "
"adding :ref:`product images and videos <ecommerce/products/images>`, "
"creating :ref:`product combinations <ecommerce/products/combos>`, "
"implementing :ref:`cross-selling and upselling strategies <ecommerce/"
"products/cross_upselling>`, attaching :ref:`digital files <ecommerce/"
"products/digital-files>`, :ref:`translating <ecommerce/products/"
"translation>` product information, :ref:`managing stock <ecommerce/products/"
"stock-management>`, and setting :ref:`packaging options <ecommerce/products/"
"stock-management/packagings>`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo Webshop giver dig mulighed for at :ref:`oprette produkter <ecommerce/"
"products/product-creation>` og administrere deres :ref:`synlighed <ecommerce/"
"products/publish-products>` på hjemmesiden. Produkter kan :ref:`konfigureres "
"<ecommerce/products/product-configuration>` på forskellige måder, herunder "
"tilføjelse af :ref:`produktbilleder og -videoer <ecommerce/products/"
"images>`, oprettelse af :ref:`produktkombinationer <ecommerce/products/"
"combos>`, implementering af :ref:`krydssalgs- og mersalgsstrategier "
"<ecommerce/products/cross_upselling>`, vedhæftning af :ref:`digitale filer "
"<ecommerce/products/digital-files>`, :ref:`oversættelse <ecommerce/products/"
"translation>` af produktoplysninger, :ref:`administration af lager "
"<ecommerce/products/stock-management>` og indstilling "
"af :ref:`emballagemuligheder <ecommerce/products/stock-management/"
"packagings>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:18
msgid "Product creation"
msgstr "Produktoprettelse"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:20
msgid ""
"To create a product from the frontend, go to the Website app, "
"click :guilabel:`New` :icon:`fa-caret-down` in the top-right corner, then "
"select :guilabel:`Product`. Enter the product name and other relevant "
"details, such as the :guilabel:`Barcode`, :guilabel:`Sales Price`, "
"default :guilabel:`Sales Taxes`, and a :ref:`Website Category <ecommerce/"
"categories_variants/categories>`, then add an image. Once you "
"click :guilabel:`Save`, you are redirected to the product page where you "
"can :ref:`customize it <ecommerce_design/product_page/customization>` using "
"the :doc:`website editor </applications/websites/website/web_design>`. Once "
"you are finished, click :guilabel:`Save`. To configure additional "
"advanced :ref:`product details <ecommerce/products/product-configuration>`, "
"click :guilabel:`Product` in the top-right corner to access the backend "
"product form."
msgstr ""
"For at oprette et produkt fra frontend skal du gå til appen Hjemmeside, "
"klikke på :guilabel:`Ny` :icon:`fa-caret-down` i øverste højre hjørne og "
"derefter vælge :guilabel:`Produkt`. Indtast :guilabel:`produktnavnet` og "
"andre relevante detaljer såsom :guilabel:`stregkode`, :guilabel:`salgspris`, "
"standard :guilabel:`salgsafgifter` og en :ref:`hjemmesidekategori <ecommerce/"
"categories_variants/categories>`, og tilføj derefter et billede. Når du "
"klikker på :guilabel:`Gem`, bliver du omdirigeret til produktsiden, hvor du "
"kan :ref:`tilpasse den <ecommerce_design/product_page/customization>` ved "
"hjælp af :doc:`hjemmesideredigeringsværktøjet </applications/websites/"
"website/web_design>`. Når du er færdig, skal du klikke på :guilabel:`Gem`. "
"For at konfigurere yderligere avancerede :ref:`produktdetaljer <ecommerce/"
"products/product-configuration>` skal du klikke på :guilabel:`Produkt` i "
"øverste højre hjørne for at få adgang til backend-produktformularen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:31
msgid ""
"It is also possible to create a product from the backend by navigating "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> eCommerce --> Products`. Then:"
msgstr ""
"Det er også muligt at oprette et produkt fra backend ved at navigere "
"til :menuselection:`Hjemmeside --> Webshop --> Produkter`. Derefter:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:34
msgid "Configure a new product by clicking :guilabel:`New`, or"
msgstr "Konfigurer et nyt produkt ved at klikke på :guilabel:`Ny`, eller"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:35
msgid ""
":doc:`Import product data </applications/sales/sales/products_prices/"
"products/import>` by clicking the :icon:`fa-cog` (:guilabel:`gear`) icon "
"next to :guilabel:`Products`. Then:"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Importér produktdata </applications/sales/sales/products_prices/"
"products/import>` ved at klikke på ikonet :icon:`fa-cog` "
"(:guilabel:`tandhjul`) ud for :guilabel:`Produkter`. Derefter:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:38
msgid ""
"Select :icon:`fa-download` :ref:`Import <essentials/export_import_data/"
"import-data>`, then click :guilabel:`Upload` to import an XLSX or CSV file "
"from your device; or"
msgstr ""
"Vælg :icon:`fa-download` :ref:`Importér <essentials/export_import_data/"
"import-data>`, og klik derefter på :guilabel:`Upload` for at importere en "
"XLSX- eller CSV-fil fra din enhed; eller"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:40
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`fa-globe` :ref:`Import from website <website_creation/import>` "
"to import the product catalog from an existing external website."
msgstr ""
"Klik på :icon:`fa-globe` :ref:`Importér fra website <website_creation/"
"import>` for at importere produktkataloget fra et eksisterende eksternt "
"website."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:44
msgid ""
":doc:`Create new products using the Barcode Lookup database </applications/"
"inventory_and_mrp/barcode/setup/barcodelookup>`."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Opret nye produkter ved hjælp af Barcode Lookup-databasen </"
"applications/inventory_and_mrp/barcode/setup/barcodelookup>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:46
msgid ""
":doc:`Configure the Gelato connector in Odoo to synchronize the product "
"catalog and automate order fulfillment with Gelato </applications/sales/"
"sales/gelato>`."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Konfigurer Gelato-connectoren i Odoo for at synkronisere "
"produktkataloget og automatisere ordrebehandling med Gelato </applications/"
"sales/sales/gelato>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:50
msgid "Product visibility"
msgstr "Produktsynlighed"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:54
msgid ""
"To publish a product, access the product page on the website and switch the "
"toggle from :guilabel:`Unpublished` to :guilabel:`Published`."
msgstr ""
"For at publicere et produkt skal du gå til produktsiden på hjemmesiden og "
"skifte knappen fra :guilabel:`Upubliceret` til :guilabel:`Publiceret`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:58
msgid ""
"To access the product page from the product form in the backend, click "
"the :icon:`fa-globe` :guilabel:`Go to Website` smart button."
msgstr ""
"For at åbne produktsiden fra produktformularen i backend'en skal du klikke "
"på :icon:`fa-globe` :guilabel:`Gå til hjemmeside`-smartknappen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:60
msgid ""
"To publish products from the backend, navigate to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` "
"tab of the :ref:`product form <ecommerce/products/product-form>`, then go to "
"the :guilabel:`Shop` section and toggle the :guilabel:`Published` switch on "
"or choose a date from the :guilabel:`Publish on` field to automatically "
"publish the product on the given date and time."
msgstr ""
"For at udgive produkter fra backend skal du gå til "
"fanen :guilabel:`eCommerce` på :ref:`produktformularen <ecommerce/products/"
"product-form>`, derefter gå til sektionen :guilabel:`Butik` og aktivere "
"kontakten :guilabel:`Udgivet` eller vælge en dato i feltet :guilabel:`Udgiv "
"den` for automatisk at udgive produktet på det angivne tidspunkt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:65
msgid "To publish multiple products at once, follow these steps:"
msgstr "For at publicere flere produkter på én gang skal du følge disse trin:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:67
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Website --> eCommerce --> Products`."
msgstr "Gå til :menuselection:`Hjemmeside --> Webshop --> Produkter`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:68
msgid ""
"Remove the :guilabel:`Published` filter and switch to the :guilabel:`List` "
"view."
msgstr ""
"Fjern filteret :guilabel:`Udgivet`, og skift til visningen :guilabel:`Liste`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:69
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-sliders` (:guilabel:`dropdown toggle`) icon on the far "
"right of the view and enable :guilabel:`Is Published`."
msgstr ""
"Klik på ikonet :icon:`fa-sliders` (:guilabel:`dropdown-knap`) helt til højre "
"i visningen og aktivér :guilabel:`Er publiceret`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:71
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Is Published` column to re-order it by *published* or "
"*unpublished* products."
msgstr ""
"Klik på kolonnen :guilabel:`Er publiceret` for at omarrangere den efter "
"*publicerede* eller *upublicerede* produkter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:73
msgid "Select the products to publish by ticking their box on the far left."
msgstr ""
"Vælg de produkter, der skal publiceres, ved at markere deres boks helt til "
"venstre."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:74
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Is Published` column, tick the box for any of the selected "
"products, then :guilabel:`Update` to publish them."
msgstr ""
"I kolonnen :guilabel:`Er publiceret` skal du markere boksen for et af de "
"valgte produkter og derefter :guilabel:`Opdater` for at publicere dem."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:80
msgid ""
"When managing multiple websites, the availability of a product on each "
"website can be set from the :ref:`product form <ecommerce/products/product-"
"form>`. Navigate to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` tab, then in "
"the :guilabel:`Shop` section, select the :guilabel:`Website` where the "
"product should be available. Leave the field blank to make the product "
"available on *all* websites. You can make a product available on either "
"*one* website or *all* websites, but selecting only *some* websites is not "
"possible. To sell the product on multiple specific websites without making "
"it available on all of them, **duplicate** the product for each website and "
"assign the corresponding website to each duplicate."
msgstr ""
"Når du administrerer flere hjemmesider, kan tilgængeligheden af et produkt "
"på hver hjemmeside indstilles fra :ref:`produktformularen <ecommerce/"
"products/product-form>`. Gå til fanen :guilabel:`Salg`, og vælg derefter i "
"sektionen :guilabel:`Webshop` den :guilabel:`Hjemmeside`, hvor produktet "
"skal være tilgængeligt. Lad feltet stå tomt for at gøre produktet "
"tilgængeligt på *alle* hjemmesider. Du kan gøre et produkt tilgængeligt på "
"enten *én* hjemmeside eller *alle* hjemmesider, men at vælge kun *nogle* "
"hjemmesider er ikke muligt. For at sælge produktet på flere specifikke "
"hjemmesider uden at gøre det tilgængeligt på alle, skal du **duplikere** "
"produktet for hver hjemmeside og tildele den tilsvarende hjemmeside til hver "
"duplikat."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:92
msgid "Product configuration"
msgstr "Produktkonfiguration"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:96
msgid ""
"To add general information to a product, navigate to :menuselection:`Website "
"--> eCommerce --> Products` and select the relevant product. You can "
"configure various options, such as choosing a :doc:`product type </"
"applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/"
"type>`, adding :doc:`variants and categories <categories_variants>`, or "
"defining :doc:`prices <prices>`."
msgstr ""
"For at tilføje generel information til et produkt skal du gå "
"til :menuselection:`Hjemmeside --> Webshop --> Produkter` og vælge det "
"relevante produkt. Du kan konfigurere forskellige indstillinger, såsom at "
"vælge en :doc:`produkttype </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"product_management/configure/type>`, tilføje :doc:`varianter og kategorier "
"<categories_variants>` eller definere :doc:`priser <prices>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:103
msgid ""
"Additionally, add an e-commerce-specific product description to be displayed "
"below the product name on the frontend :doc:`product page <../"
"ecommerce_design/product_page>`. To do so, go to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` "
"tab, scroll down to the :guilabel:`Long description` section, and write a "
"description. Use Odoo's :doc:`rich-text editor </applications/essentials/"
"html_editor>` to customize the content."
msgstr ""
"Du kan desuden tilføje en e-handelsspecifik produktbeskrivelse, der vises "
"under produktnavnet på frontendens :doc:`produktside <../ecommerce_design/"
"product_page>`. For at gøre dette skal du gå til "
"fanen :guilabel:`eCommerce`, rulle ned til sektionen :guilabel:`Lang "
"beskrivelse` og skrive en beskrivelse. Brug Odoos :doc:`rich text-editor </"
"applications/essentials/html_editor>` til at tilpasse indholdet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:110
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-globe` :guilabel:`Go to Website` smart button to access "
"the frontend product page and :doc:`customize <../ecommerce_design/"
"product_page>` it using the :doc:`website editor <../../website/web_design>`."
msgstr ""
"Klik på :icon:`fa-globe` :guilabel:`Gå til hjemmeside`-smartknappen for at "
"åbne frontend-produktsiden og :doc:`tilpasse <../ecommerce_design/"
"product_page>` den ved hjælp af :doc:`hjemmeside-editoren <../../website/"
"web_design>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:113
msgid ""
"Product descriptions can also be generated using :doc:`AI </applications/"
"productivity/ai>`. To do so, type `/` in the :guilabel:`Long description` "
"section and select :guilabel:`AI` to open the :doc:`AI agent </applications/"
"productivity/ai/agents>`."
msgstr ""
"Produktbeskrivelser kan også genereres ved hjælp af :doc:`AI </applications/"
"productivity/ai>`. For at gøre dette skal du skrive `/` i "
"sektionen :guilabel:`Lang beskrivelse` og vælge :guilabel:`AI` for at "
"åbne :doc:`AI-agenten </applications/productivity/ai/agents>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:120
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:17
msgid "Product images and videos"
msgstr "Produktbilleder og -videoer"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:122
msgid ""
"To add media items, such as images and videos, navigate to the :ref:`product "
"form <ecommerce/products/product-form>` and go to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` "
"tab. In the :guilabel:`Media` section, click :guilabel:`Add Media`. In "
"the :guilabel:`Select a media` pop-up window:"
msgstr ""
"For at tilføje medieelementer, såsom billeder og videoer, skal du gå "
"til :ref:`produktformularen <ecommerce/products/product-form>` og derefter "
"til fanen :guilabel:`eCommerce`. I sektionen :guilabel:`Medier` skal du "
"klikke på :guilabel:`Tilføj medier`. I pop op-vinduet :guilabel:`Vælg et "
"medie`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:126
msgid ""
"To add an image, select an image, click :guilabel:`Add URL` "
"or :guilabel:`Upload an image` in the :guilabel:`Images` tab."
msgstr ""
"For at tilføje et billede skal du vælge et billede, klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Tilføj URL` eller :guilabel:`Upload et billede` i "
"fanen :guilabel:`Billeder`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:128
msgid ""
"To add a video, navigate to the :guilabel:`Videos` tab, paste a video URL, "
"or :ref:`embed HTML code <website/building_blocks/embed_code>`. Then, enable "
"the relevant :ref:`video options <website/elements/videos>`."
msgstr ""
"For at tilføje en video skal du gå til fanen :guilabel:`Videoer`, indsætte "
"en video-URL eller :ref:`indlejre HTML-kode <website/building_blocks/"
"embed_code>`. Aktivér derefter de relevante :ref:`videoindstillinger "
"<website/elements/videos>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:132
msgid "Once the media is selected, click :guilabel:`Add`."
msgstr "Når mediet er valgt, skal du klikke på :guilabel:`Tilføj`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:135
msgid ""
":ref:`Customize product images and videos <ecommerce/product_page/image-"
"customization>` using the :doc:`website editor <../../website/web_design>` "
"from the frontend."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Tilpas produktbilleder og -videoer <ecommerce/product_page/image-"
"customization>` ved hjælp af :doc:`hjemmeside-editoren <../../website/"
"web_design>` fra frontend'en."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:141
msgid "Product combos"
msgstr "Produktkombinationer"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:143
msgid ""
":ref:`Product combinations <pos/products/combos>` allow users to configure a "
"set of related products to buy as a bundle. To :ref:`configure combos <pos/"
"products/combo-choices>`, go to :menuselection:`Website --> eCommerce --> "
"Combo Choices`. Once finished and published, customers can choose the combo "
"when adding the product to the cart. Depending on the configuration, certain "
"items may incur an additional charge."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Produktkombinationer <pos/products/combos>` giver brugerne mulighed "
"for at konfigurere et sæt relaterede produkter, der kan købes som en pakke. "
"For at :ref:`konfigurere kombinationer <pos/products/combo-choices>`, gå "
"til :menuselection:`Hjemmeside --> Webshop --> Kombovalg`. Når det er "
"færdigt og offentliggjort, kan kunder vælge kombinationen, når de tilføjer "
"produktet til indkøbskurven. Afhængigt af konfigurationen kan visse varer "
"medføre en ekstra omkostning."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:149
msgid "Add the combo product to the cart."
msgstr "Tilføj kombinationsproduktet til indkøbskurven."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:156
msgid "Cross-selling & Upselling"
msgstr "Krydssalg og mersalg"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:158
msgid ""
"Cross-selling and upselling are sales techniques used to present customers "
"with additional or higher-tier products and services from the :doc:`catalog "
"<../../ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog>`. Cross-selling focuses on "
"recommending accessory or :doc:`optional products </applications/sales/sales/"
"sales_quotations/optional_products>` alongside the item being purchased "
"during ordering and checkout. Upselling, on the other hand, encourages "
"customers to choose a higher-priced or upgraded alternative product."
msgstr ""
"Krydssalg og mersalg er salgsteknikker, der bruges til at præsentere kunder "
"for yderligere produkter eller produkter af højere kvalitet "
"fra :doc:`kataloget <../../ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog>`. Krydssalg "
"fokuserer på at anbefale tilbehør eller :doc:`valgfrie produkter </"
"applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/optional_products>` sammen med den "
"vare, der købes under bestilling og betaling. Mersalg tilskynder derimod "
"kunderne til at vælge et dyrere eller opgraderet alternativt produkt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:165
msgid ""
"To configure these product suggestions, go to :menuselection:`Website --> "
"eCommerce --> Products`, select the relevant product, go to "
"the :guilabel:`Sales` tab, and add the desired products in the "
"corresponding :guilabel:`Optional Products`, :guilabel:`Accessory Products`, "
"and/or :guilabel:`Alternative Products` fields."
msgstr ""
"For at konfigurere disse produktforslag skal du gå "
"til :menuselection:`Hjemmeside --> Webshop --> Produkter`, vælge det "
"relevante produkt, gå til fanen :guilabel:`Salg` og tilføje de ønskede "
"produkter i de tilsvarende felter :guilabel:`Valgfrie "
"produkter`, :guilabel:`Tilbehørsprodukter` og/eller :guilabel:`Alternative "
"produkter`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:172
msgid "Optional products"
msgstr "Valgfrie produkter"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:174
msgid ""
"Optional products are suggested when the customer clicks the :guilabel:`Add "
"to cart` button to buy a specific product."
msgstr ""
"Valgfrie produkter foreslås, når kunden klikker på knappen :guilabel:`Tilføj "
"til kurv` for at købe et specifikt produkt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:177
msgid "Optional products cross-selling."
msgstr "Krydssalg med valgfrie produkter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:180
msgid "Accessory products"
msgstr "Tilbehørsprodukter"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:182
msgid ""
"Accessory products appear in the :guilabel:`Suggested accessories` section "
"during the :guilabel:`Order summary` step, just prior to proceeding to "
"checkout."
msgstr ""
"Tilbehørsprodukter vises i afsnittet :guilabel:`Foreslået tilbehør` under "
"trinnet :guilabel:`Ordreoversigt`, lige inden kassen åbnes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:185
msgid "Suggested accessories at checkout during cart review"
msgstr "Foreslået tilbehør ved kassen under gennemgang af indkøbskurv"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:189
msgid ""
"To hide this section, open the :doc:`website editor <../../website/"
"web_design>`, go to the :guilabel:`Style` tab, and toggle "
"the :guilabel:`Suggested Accessories` switch off."
msgstr ""
"For at skjule dette afsnit skal du åbne :doc:`hjemmesideredigeringsværktøjet "
"<../../website/web_design>`, gå til fanen :guilabel:`Stil` og slå "
"kontakten :guilabel:`Foreslået tilbehør` fra."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:192
msgid "Alternative products"
msgstr "Alternative produkter"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:194
msgid ""
"Alternative products are displayed at the bottom of the :doc:`product page "
"<../ecommerce_design/product_page>` under the :guilabel:`Alternative "
"Products` heading."
msgstr ""
"Alternative produkter vises nederst på :doc:`produktsiden <../"
"ecommerce_design/product_page>` under overskriften :guilabel:`Alternative "
"produkter`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:197
msgid "The alternative products section of an product page."
msgstr "Afsnittet med alternative produkter på en produktside."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:201
msgid ""
"To customize this block, open the :doc:`website editor <../../website/"
"web_design>`, click the block on the page, and :doc:`adapt the heading and "
"text <../../website/web_design/elements>` if necessary. Go to "
"the :guilabel:`Style` tab, scroll to the :guilabel:`Alternative Products` "
"section, and modify the options as needed."
msgstr ""
"For at tilpasse denne blok skal du åbne :doc:`hjemmesideredigeringsværktøjet "
"<../../website/web_design>`, klikke på blokken på siden og :doc:`tilpasse "
"overskrift og tekst <../../website/web_design/elements>` om nødvendigt. Gå "
"til fanen :guilabel:`Stil`, rul ned til afsnittet :guilabel:`Alternative "
"produkter` og tilpas indstillingerne efter behov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:207
msgid ""
"To automatically add optional, accessory, and alternative products in "
"the :guilabel:`Sales` tab, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --"
"> Settings`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` section, and "
"enable :guilabel:`Automate suggested products`. Suggested products are "
"assigned to each product based on its :ref:`e-commerce category <ecommerce/"
"categories_variants/categories>`."
msgstr ""
"For automatisk at tilføje valgfrie produkter, tilbehørsprodukter og "
"alternative produkter på fanen :guilabel:`Salg` skal du gå "
"til :menuselection:`Websted --> Konfiguration --> Indstillinger`, rulle ned "
"til sektionen :guilabel:`Webshop` og aktivere :guilabel:`Automatiser "
"foreslåede produkter`. Foreslåede produkter tildeles hvert produkt baseret "
"på dets :ref:`webshopkategori <ecommerce/categories_variants/categories>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:216
msgid "Digital files"
msgstr "Digitale filer"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:218
msgid ""
"It is possible to link digital files, such as certificates, eBooks, or user "
"manuals, to the products. To do so, go to the :ref:`product form <ecommerce/"
"products/product-form>` and click the :icon:`fa-file-text-"
"o` :guilabel:`Documents` smart button. Then, click :guilabel:`Upload` to "
"upload a file directly, or for additional options, click :guilabel:`New`. "
"Choose the :guilabel:`Type` of attachment:"
msgstr ""
"Det er muligt at linke digitale filer, såsom certifikater, e-bøger eller "
"brugermanualer, til produkterne. For at gøre dette skal du gå "
"til :ref:`produktformularen <ecommerce/products/product-form>` og klikke på "
"den smarte knap :icon:`fa-file-text-o` :guilabel:`Dokumenter`. Klik derefter "
"på :guilabel:`Upload` for at uploade en fil direkte, eller klik "
"på :guilabel:`Ny` for flere muligheder. Vælg :guilabel:`Type` af vedhæftning:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:224
msgid ":guilabel:`File`: :guilabel:`Upload your file`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Fil`: :guilabel:`Upload din fil`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:225
msgid ":guilabel:`URL`: Insert the link to the file or media item."
msgstr ":guilabel:`URL`: Indsæt linket til filen eller medieobjektet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:226
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Cloud Storage` (if applicable): Insert a link to your cloud "
"storage to store the file on the :doc:`cloud storage </applications/general/"
"integrations/cloud_storage>` platform instead of the database’s server."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Cloudlagring` (hvis relevant): Indsæt et link til din "
"cloudlagring for at gemme filen på :doc:`cloudlagringsplatformen </"
"applications/general/integrations/cloud_storage>` i stedet for databasens "
"server."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:230
msgid "These documents can be made available:"
msgstr "Disse dokumenter kan gøres tilgængelige:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:232
msgid ""
"On the product page (before checkout): Set the :guilabel:`Sales visibility` "
"field to :guilabel:`Hidden` and enable :guilabel:`Publish on website`."
msgstr ""
"På produktsiden (før betaling): Indstil feltet :guilabel:`Salgssynlighed` "
"til :guilabel:`Skjult` og aktiver :guilabel:`Publicer på hjemmeside`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:234
msgid ""
"In the :doc:`customer portal </applications/general/users/user_portals>` on "
"the confirmed sales order (after checkout): Set the :guilabel:`Sales "
"visibility` field to :guilabel:`On confirmed order` and "
"disable :guilabel:`Publish on website`."
msgstr ""
"I :doc:`kundeportalen </applications/general/users/user_portals>` på den "
"bekræftede salgsordre (efter betaling): Indstil "
"feltet :guilabel:`Salgssynlighed` til :guilabel:`Ved bekræftet ordre` og "
"deaktiver :guilabel:`Publicer på hjemmeside`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:239
msgid ""
"In :ref:`Kanban <studio/views/multiple-records/kanban>` view, click "
"the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`dropdown menu`) in the top-right "
"corner of the document card to :guilabel:`Edit`, :guilabel:`Delete`, "
"or :guilabel:`Download` the document."
msgstr ""
"I :ref:`Kanban <studio/views/multiple-records/kanban>`-visning klikkes "
"på :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`rullemenuen`) i øverste højre hjørne af "
"dokumentkortet for at :guilabel:`Redigere`, :guilabel:`Slette` "
"eller :guilabel:`Downloade` dokumentet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:246
msgid "Translation"
msgstr "Oversættelse"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:248
msgid ""
"If a website is available in multiple languages, product information can be "
"translated directly on the :ref:`product form <ecommerce/products/product-"
"form>`. Fields that support multiple languages are identifiable by their "
"language abbreviation (e.g., `EN`) next to the field, such as "
"the :guilabel:`Product name`, :ref:`Out-of-Stock Message <ecommerce/products/"
"stock-management>`, the :ref:`e-commerce description <ecommerce/products/"
"description>`, :ref:`ribbon or badge <ecommerce/products/additional_features/"
"product-highlight>` names, :doc:`categories and variants "
"<categories_variants>` names, etc."
msgstr ""
"Hvis en hjemmeside er tilgængelig på flere sprog, kan produktinformation "
"oversættes direkte på :ref:`produktformularen <ecommerce/products/product-"
"form>`. Felter, der understøtter flere sprog, kan identificeres ved deres "
"sprogforkortelse (f.eks. `EN`) ved siden af feltet, "
"såsom :guilabel:`Produktnavn`, :ref:`Besked ved udsolgt <ecommerce/products/"
"stock-management>`, :ref:`E-handelsbeskrivelse <ecommerce/products/"
"description>`, :ref:`bånd- eller badgenavne <ecommerce/products/"
"additional_features/product-highlight>`, :doc:`kategori- og variantnavne "
"<categories_variants>` osv."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:257
msgid ""
"Having untranslated content on a web page may be detrimental to the user "
"experience and :doc:`SEO </applications/websites/website/structure/seo>`. To "
"avoid this, use the :ref:`Translate <translate/translate>` feature to "
"translate any remaining untranslated content on the page."
msgstr ""
"At have uoversat indhold på en webside kan være skadeligt for "
"brugeroplevelsen og :doc:`SEO </applications/websites/website/structure/"
"seo>`. For at undgå dette skal du bruge :ref:`Oversæt <translate/translate>`-"
"funktionen til at oversætte eventuelle resterende uoversatte indhold på "
"siden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:263
msgid ""
":doc:`Website languages and translations </applications/websites/website/"
"configuration/translate>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Hjemmesidesprog og oversættelser </applications/websites/website/"
"configuration/translate>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:269
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:178
msgid "Stock management"
msgstr "Lagerstyring"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:271
msgid ""
"To configure stock-related e-commerce options, go to :menuselection:`Website "
"--> Configuration --> Settings`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` "
"section, then to the :guilabel:`Inventory Defaults` subsection. The "
"following settings are available:"
msgstr ""
"For at konfigurere lagerrelaterede webshop-muligheder gå "
"til :menuselection:`Hjemmeside --> Konfiguration --> Indstillinger`, rul ned "
"til sektionen :guilabel:`Webshop` og derefter til "
"undersektionen :guilabel:`Lagerstandarder`. Følgende indstillinger er "
"tilgængelige:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:275
msgid ""
"If multiple :doc:`warehouses </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"warehouses_storage/inventory_management/warehouses>` exist, select the "
"relevant one from the :guilabel:`Warehouse` dropdown menu to set it as the "
"default."
msgstr ""
"Hvis der findes flere :doc:`lagre </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"warehouses_storage/inventory_management/warehouses>`, vælg det relevante "
"fra :guilabel:`Lager`-rullemenuen for at angive det som standard."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:279
msgid ""
"Next to :guilabel:`Out-of-Stock`, enable :guilabel:`Continue Selling` to "
"allow customers to place orders even when the product is out of stock. Keep "
"this option disabled to prevent customers from ordering products that are "
"out of stock."
msgstr ""
"Ved siden af :guilabel:`Udsolgt` aktiveres :guilabel:`Fortsæt salg` for at "
"give kunderne mulighed for at afgive ordrer, selv når produktet er udsolgt. "
"Hold denne mulighed deaktiveret for at forhindre kunder i at bestille "
"produkter, der er udsolgt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:282
msgid ""
"Enable the :guilabel:`Show Available Quantity` option to display the "
"remaining available quantity on the product page when it drops below a "
"defined threshold. The available quantity is calculated based on "
"the :guilabel:`On hand` quantity minus the quantity already :doc:`reserved </"
"applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"reservation_methods>` for outgoing transfers."
msgstr ""
"Aktivér :guilabel:`Vis tilgængelig mængde`-muligheden for at vise den "
"resterende tilgængelige mængde på produktsiden, når den falder under en "
"defineret tærskel. Den tilgængelige mængde beregnes baseret på :guilabel:`På "
"lager`-mængden minus mængden, der allerede er :doc:`reserveret </"
"applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"reservation_methods>` til udgående overførsler."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:288
msgid ""
"These settings apply to *all* products, but can be adapted for individual "
"products if needed. To do so, go to the product form and ensure "
"the :ref:`Track inventory option <inventory/product_management/tracking-"
"inventory>` is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Disse indstillinger gælder for *alle* produkter, men kan tilpasses for "
"individuelle produkter efter behov. For at gøre dette skal du gå til "
"produktformularen og sikre, at :ref:`indstillingen Spor lager <inventory/"
"product_management/tracking-inventory>` er aktiveret."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:293
msgid ""
"When the :doc:`Inventory app </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory>` is "
"installed, and :ref:`lots and serial numbers are enabled <inventory/"
"product_management/enable-lot-serial>`, select an option from "
"the :guilabel:`Tracking` dropdown menu."
msgstr ""
"Når :doc:`Lager-appen </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory>` er "
"installeret, og :ref:`parti- og serienumre er aktiveret <inventory/"
"product_management/enable-lot-serial>`, skal du vælge en mulighed i "
"rullemenuen :guilabel:`Sporing`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:297
msgid ""
"Then, navigate to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` tab and, in "
"the :guilabel:`Inventory` section, enable or disable the "
"relevant :guilabel:`Sell when Out-of-Stock` and :guilabel:`Show Available "
"Qty` options. You can also compose a custom :guilabel:`Out-of-Stock "
"Message`. If the field is left empty, the default message `Out of Stock` is "
"displayed on the product page when the item is no longer in stock."
msgstr ""
"Gå derefter til fanen :guilabel:`E-handel` og, i "
"sektionen :guilabel:`Lager`, aktivér eller deaktivér de relevante "
"indstillinger :guilabel:`Sælg, når den ikke er på lager` og :guilabel:`Vis "
"tilgængelig mængde`. Du kan også oprette en tilpasset :guilabel:`Ikke på "
"lager-besked`. Hvis feltet efterlades tomt, vises standardbeskeden `Ikke på "
"lager` på produktsiden, når varen ikke længere er på lager."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:303
msgid ""
"Modifying the general :guilabel:`Inventory Defaults` settings does not "
"automatically modify the related option(s) on the product form for existing "
"products; it only affects products created after the feature is enabled/"
"disabled."
msgstr ""
"Ændring af de generelle :guilabel:`Lagerstandarder`-indstillinger ændrer "
"ikke automatisk de relaterede muligheder på produktformularen for "
"eksisterende produkter; det påvirker kun produkter oprettet efter funktionen "
"er aktiveret/deaktiveret."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:306
msgid ""
"To display the stock level on the product page, the :guilabel:`Product Type` "
"field on the :ref:`product form <ecommerce/products/product-form>` must be "
"set to :guilabel:`Goods` or :guilabel:`Combo`."
msgstr ""
"For at vise lagerniveauet på produktsiden skal "
"feltet :guilabel:`Produkttype` på :ref:`produktformularen <ecommerce/"
"products/product-form>` være indstillet til :guilabel:`Varer` "
"eller :guilabel:`Combo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:309
msgid ""
"A :icon:`fa-envelope-o` (:guilabel:`envelope`) :guilabel:`Get notified when "
"back in stock` button appears on the product page when an item is out of "
"stock. Customers can click the link to enter their email address and receive "
"a notification once the item is back in stock."
msgstr ""
"En :icon:`fa-envelope-o` (:guilabel:`konvolut`) :guilabel:`Få besked, når "
"varen er på lager igen`-knap vises på produktsiden, når en vare er udsolgt. "
"Kunder kan klikke på linket for at indtaste deres e-mailadresse og modtage "
"en meddelelse, når varen er på lager igen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:313
msgid ""
"You can also add an :ref:`out-of-stock ribbon or badge <ecommerce/products/"
"additional_features/product-highlight>` in the :guilabel:`Shop` section of "
"the :guilabel:`eCommerce` tab on the :ref:`product form <ecommerce/products/"
"product-form>`."
msgstr ""
"Du kan også tilføje et :ref:`ikke på lager-bånd eller -badge <ecommerce/"
"products/additional_features/product-highlight>` i "
"sektionen :guilabel:`Shop` på fanen :guilabel:`E-handel` "
"på :ref:`produktformularen <ecommerce/products/product-form>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:316
msgid ""
"If the :ref:`Click & Collect <ecommerce/shipping/instore-pickup>` feature is "
"enabled, the product availability is displayed on the product page based on "
"the stock in the warehouse defined on the related :doc:`delivery method </"
"applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"setup_configuration/new_delivery_method>` form."
msgstr ""
"Hvis :ref:`Click & Collect <ecommerce/shipping/instore-pickup>`-funktionen "
"er aktiveret, vises produkttilgængeligheden på produktsiden baseret på "
"lageret i det lager, der er defineret på den "
"relaterede :doc:`leveringsmetode </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/new_delivery_method>`-formular."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:323
msgid ""
"Currently, the `Boko Chair` is not available in any warehouses. However, "
"customers can click the :icon:`fa-envelope-o` "
"(:guilabel:`envelope`) :guilabel:`Get notified when back in stock` link to "
"receive a notification as soon as the product becomes available again. A "
"custom :guilabel:`Out-of-Stock Message` can also be added to inform "
"customers that the item will be replenished."
msgstr ""
"I øjeblikket er `Boko Chair` ikke tilgængelig i nogen lagre. Kunderne kan "
"dog klikke på :icon:`fa-envelope-o` (:guilabel:`konvolut`) :guilabel:`Få "
"besked, når produktet er på lager igen`-linket for at modtage en meddelelse, "
"så snart produktet bliver tilgængeligt igen. En :guilabel:`Besked ved "
"udsolgt` kan også tilføjes for at informere kunderne om, at varen vil blive "
"genopfyldt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:329
msgid ""
"Example of a product that is out of stock, but which will be available again."
msgstr ""
"Eksempel på et produkt, der er udsolgt, men som vil være tilgængeligt igen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:333
msgid ""
"If a unique reference is needed for inventory management, install "
"the :doc:`Manufacturing app </applications/inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing>` "
"and create :doc:`kit bills of materials </applications/inventory_and_mrp/"
"manufacturing/advanced_configuration/kit_shipping>`. Each kit links its "
"published \"virtual\" products to the main reference tracked in Inventory. "
"This ensures that any item sold on the website is converted into the "
"corresponding stocked item in the delivery order."
msgstr ""
"Hvis der er behov for en unik reference til lagerstyring, skal du "
"installere :doc:`Produktions-appen </applications/inventory_and_mrp/"
"manufacturing>` og oprette :doc:`kit-styklister </applications/"
"inventory_and_mrp/manufacturing/advanced_configuration/kit_shipping>`. Hvert "
"kit linker sine publicerede \"virtuelle\" produkter til hovedreferencen, der "
"spores i Lager. Dette sikrer, at enhver vare solgt på hjemmesiden "
"konverteres til den tilsvarende lagerførte vare i leveringsordren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:343
msgid "Packagings"
msgstr "Emballager"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:345
msgid ""
"To offer different product pack sizes to customers on the e-commerce, "
"configure product :doc:`packagings </applications/inventory_and_mrp/"
"inventory/product_management/configure/packaging>`. Then go to "
"the :ref:`product form <ecommerce/products/product-form>` and navigate to "
"the :guilabel:`Sales` tab. Under :guilabel:`Upsell & cross-sell`, add as "
"many package types as needed in the :guilabel:`Packagings` field. The "
"available package types are displayed on the e-commerce :doc:`product page "
"<../ecommerce_design/product_page>`."
msgstr ""
"For at tilbyde forskellige produktpakningsstørrelser til kunderne på "
"webshop'en skal du konfigurere produkt-:doc:`emballager </applications/"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/product_management/configure/packaging>`. Gå "
"derefter til :ref:`produktformularen <ecommerce/products/product-form>` og "
"naviger til fanen :guilabel:`Salg`. Under :guilabel:`Mersalg & krydssalg` "
"tilføjes så mange pakketyper som nødvendigt i feltet :guilabel:`Emballager`. "
"De tilgængelige pakketyper vises på webshoppens :doc:`produktside <../"
"ecommerce_design/product_page>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:353
msgid "Product packages on the e-commerce page."
msgstr "Produktpakninger på webshoppen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:357
msgid ""
"It is also possible to add packagings to a specific :ref:`product variant "
"<ecommerce/categories_variants/product-variants>`. To do so, go to the "
"product form, click the :icon:`fa-sitemap` :guilabel:`Variants` :ref:`smart "
"button <products/variants/variants-smart-button>`, and select the relevant "
"product variant. Under :guilabel:`Sales`, add as many package types as "
"needed in the :guilabel:`Packagings` field."
msgstr ""
"Det er også muligt at tilføje pakninger til en specifik :ref:`produktvariant "
"<ecommerce/categories_variants/product-variants>`. Gå til produktformularen, "
"klik på :icon:`fa-sitemap` :guilabel:`Varianter` :ref:`smart-knappen "
"<products/variants/variants-smart-button>`, og vælg den relevante "
"produktvariant. Under :guilabel:`Salg` tilføjes så mange pakketyper som "
"nødvendigt i feltet :guilabel:`Pakninger`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/configuration/products.rst:362
msgid ""
"To prevent selected packaging units from being sold on the e-commerce, go "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings`, and scroll down "
"to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` section. Then, under :guilabel:`Restrict "
"Packagings`, select the units that should not be available for sale."
msgstr ""
"For at forhindre at valgte emballageenheder sælges på e-handlen, skal du gå "
"til :menuselection:`Websted --> Konfiguration --> Indstillinger` og rulle "
"ned til sektionen :guilabel:`e-handel`. Vælg derefter under "
":guilabel:`Begræns emballage` de enheder, der ikke skal være tilgængelige "
"for salg."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design.rst:9
msgid ""
"Customize the design of the :doc:`product pages <../ecommerce/"
"ecommerce_design/product_page>`, structure the :doc:`product catalog <../"
"ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog>` and use :doc:`additional features <../"
"ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features>` to improve the customer's "
"shopping experience."
msgstr ""
"Tilpas designet af :doc:`produktsiderne <../ecommerce/ecommerce_design/"
"product_page>`, strukturer :doc:`produktkataloget <../ecommerce/"
"ecommerce_design/catalog>` og brug :doc:`yderligere funktioner <../ecommerce/"
"ecommerce_design/additional_features>` til at forbedre kundens "
"shoppingoplevelse."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design.rst:16
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:27
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:63
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/product_page.rst:3
msgid "Product page"
msgstr "Produktside"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design.rst:16
msgid ""
"Design the product pages by showcasing product details and additional "
"information, customizing product images and videos, and adding content and "
"design elements using building blocks."
msgstr ""
"Design produktsiderne ved at fremvise produktdetaljer og yderligere "
"information, tilpasse produktbilleder og -videoer samt tilføje indhold og "
"designelementer ved hjælp af byggeklodser."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design.rst:23
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:3
msgid "Product catalog"
msgstr "Produktkatalog"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design.rst:23
msgid ""
"Organize the product catalog by customizing the layout, using categories, "
"and adding building blocks, and filtering options."
msgstr ""
"Organiser produktkataloget ved at tilpasse layoutet, bruge kategorier og "
"tilføje byggeklodser samt filtreringsmuligheder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design.rst:30
msgid ""
"Enable additional features, such as the wishlist and product comparison, and "
"highlight products using ribbons."
msgstr ""
"Aktiver yderligere funktioner som ønskelisten og produktsammenligning, og "
"fremhæv produkter ved hjælp af badges."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo eCommerce provides additional features for online shops, including "
"a :ref:`product comparison <ecommerce/products/additional_features/product-"
"comparison>` tool, a :ref:`wishlist <ecommerce/products/additional_features/"
"wishlists>`, and :ref:`product highlight options <ecommerce/products/"
"additional_features/product-highlight>`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo Webshop tilbyder yderligere funktioner til onlinebutikker, herunder "
"et :ref:`produktsammenlignings <ecommerce/products/additional_features/"
"product-comparison>`-værktøj, en :ref:`ønskeliste <ecommerce/products/"
"additional_features/wishlists>`, og :ref:`produktfremhævelsesmuligheder "
"<ecommerce/products/additional_features/product-highlight>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:13
msgid "Product comparison"
msgstr "Produktsammenligning"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:15
msgid ""
"The :icon:`fa-exchange` (:guilabel:`Add to compare`) button allows website "
"visitors to compare products based on their :ref:`attributes <ecommerce/"
"categories_variants/attributes>`. Customers can click this button to select "
"the products they wish to compare, then click :guilabel:`Compare` in the pop-"
"up window at the bottom of the page to see the comparison summary."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-exchange`-knappen (:guilabel:`Tilføj til sammenligning`) giver "
"besøgende på hjemmesiden mulighed for at sammenligne produkter baseret på "
"deres :ref:`attributter <ecommerce/categories_variants/attributes>`. Kunder "
"kan klikke på denne knap for at vælge de produkter, de ønsker at "
"sammenligne, og derefter klikke på :guilabel:`Sammenlign` i pop op-vinduet "
"nederst på siden for at se sammenligningsoversigten."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:20
msgid "Product comparison window"
msgstr "Vindue til produktsammenligning"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:23
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:59
msgid ""
"This button can be enabled independently in different sections of the "
"website:"
msgstr ""
"Denne knap kan aktiveres uafhængigt i forskellige sektioner af hjemmesiden:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:29
msgid ""
"Go to a product page, open the website editor, go to the :guilabel:`Style` "
"tab, navigate to the :guilabel:`Products Details` section, and toggle "
"the :icon:`fa-exchange` :guilabel:`Compare` button. Once done, it becomes "
"available on each product page that has attributes."
msgstr ""
"Gå til en produktside, åbn hjemmesideredigeringen, gå til "
"fanen :guilabel:`Style`, naviger til sektionen :guilabel:`Products Details`, "
"og slå knappen :icon:`fa-exchange` :guilabel:`Compare` til eller fra. Når "
"det er gjort, bliver den tilgængelig på hver produktside, der har "
"attributter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:34
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:69
msgid "Catalog page"
msgstr "Katalogside"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:36
msgid ""
"To display the :icon:`fa-exchange` (:guilabel:`Compare`) button on "
"the :ref:`shop page <ecommerce/catalog/product-listing>`, open the website "
"editor, go to the :guilabel:`Style` tab, and click the :icon:`fa-paint-"
"brush` (:guilabel:`paint brush`) icon next to :guilabel:`Product Design`. In "
"the :guilabel:`Actions` section, toggle the :icon:`fa-exchange` "
"(:guilabel:`Compare`) button, and choose between :guilabel:`Inline` "
"and :guilabel:`On Hover`."
msgstr ""
"For at vise knappen :icon:`fa-exchange` (:guilabel:`Compare`) "
"på :ref:`butikssiden <ecommerce/catalog/product-listing>`, skal du åbne "
"hjemmesideredigeringen, gå til fanen :guilabel:`Style` og klikke på "
"ikonet :icon:`fa-paint-brush` (:guilabel:`paint brush`) ved siden "
"af :guilabel:`Product Design`. I sektionen :guilabel:`Actions` skal du slå "
"knappen :icon:`fa-exchange` (:guilabel:`Compare`) til eller fra og vælge "
"mellem :guilabel:`Inline` og :guilabel:`On Hover`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:44
msgid "You can only compare a maximum of four products at a time."
msgstr "Du kan kun sammenligne op til fire produkter ad gangen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:47
msgid ""
"Define :ref:`attribute categories <ecommerce/categories_variants/attribute-"
"categories>` to group similar attributes under the same section when "
"comparing products."
msgstr ""
"Definer :ref:`attributkategorier <ecommerce/categories_variants/attribute-"
"categories>` for at gruppere lignende attributter under samme sektion, når "
"produkter sammenlignes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:53
msgid "Wishlist"
msgstr "Ønskeliste"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:55
msgid ""
"The :icon:`fa-heart-o` (:guilabel:`Add to wishlist`) button allows customers "
"to add products to their wishlist, i.e., save them for later. It is enabled "
"by default and available on each product page."
msgstr ""
"Knappen :icon:`fa-heart-o` (:guilabel:`Add to wishlist`) giver kunderne "
"mulighed for at tilføje produkter til deres ønskeliste, dvs. gemme dem til "
"senere. Den er aktiveret som standard og tilgængelig på hver produktside."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:65
msgid ""
"Go to a product page, open the website editor, go to the :guilabel:`Style` "
"tab, navigate to the :guilabel:`Products Details` section, and toggle "
"the :icon:`fa-heart` :guilabel:`Wishlist` button. Once done, it becomes "
"available on each product page."
msgstr ""
"Gå til en produktside, åbn hjemmesideredigeringen, gå til "
"fanen :guilabel:`Style`, naviger til sektionen :guilabel:`Products Details`, "
"og slå knappen :icon:`fa-heart` :guilabel:`Wishlist` til eller fra. Når det "
"er gjort, bliver den tilgængelig på hver produktside."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:71
msgid ""
"To display the :icon:`fa-heart-o` (:guilabel:`Wishlist`) button on "
"the :ref:`shop page <ecommerce/catalog/product-listing>`, open the website "
"editor, go to :guilabel:`Style`, and click the :icon:`fa-paint-brush` "
"(:guilabel:`paint brush`) icon next to :guilabel:`Product Design`. In "
"the :guilabel:`Actions` section, toggle the :icon:`fa-heart` "
"(:guilabel:`Wishlist`) button and choose between :guilabel:`Fixed` "
"and :guilabel:`Fixed - On Hover`."
msgstr ""
"For at vise knappen :icon:`fa-heart-o` (:guilabel:`Wishlist`) "
"på :ref:`butikssiden <ecommerce/catalog/product-listing>`, skal du åbne "
"hjemmesideredigeringen, gå til :guilabel:`Style` og klikke på "
"ikonet :icon:`fa-paint-brush` (:guilabel:`paint brush`) ved siden "
"af :guilabel:`Product Design`. I sektionen :guilabel:`Actions` skal du slå "
"knappen :icon:`fa-heart` (:guilabel:`Wishlist`) til eller fra og vælge "
"mellem :guilabel:`Fixed` og :guilabel:`Fixed - On Hover`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:78
msgid "Header"
msgstr "Header"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:80
msgid ""
"To display the :icon:`fa-heart` (:guilabel:`Wishlist`) icon in the header, "
"open the website editor, click the header, navigate to the :guilabel:`Show/"
"Hide Elements` section, and toggle the :icon:`fa-heart` "
"(:guilabel:`Wishlist`) icon next to :guilabel:`Show Empty`. If it is not "
"enabled, the wishlist icon only appears when an item has been added to the "
"wishlist. The number of items in the wishlist is also displayed next to the "
"icon."
msgstr ""
"For at vise ikonet :icon:`fa-heart` (:guilabel:`Wishlist`) i headeren skal "
"du åbne hjemmesideredigeringen, klikke på headeren, navigere til "
"sektionen :guilabel:`Show/Hide Elements` og slå ikonet :icon:`fa-heart` "
"(:guilabel:`Wishlist`) til eller fra ved siden af :guilabel:`Show Empty`. "
"Hvis det ikke er aktiveret, vises ønskelisteikonet kun, når en vare er "
"blevet tilføjet til ønskelisten. Antallet af varer i ønskelisten vises også "
"ved siden af ikonet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:87
msgid "Wishlist page"
msgstr "Ønskelisteside"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:89
msgid ""
"It is possible to customize the layout of the :guilabel:`My Wishlist` page. "
"To do so, open the website editor while on the wishlist page, and in "
"the :guilabel:`Style` tab under the :guilabel:`Wishlist Page` section, "
"choose a :guilabel:`Products Design`. Depending on the selected design, "
"adapt the layout according to :guilabel:`Desktop` or :guilabel:`Mobile` "
"devices. Click the :icon:`fa-paint-brush` (:guilabel:`paint brush`) icon "
"next to :guilabel:`Products Design` to access more customization options."
msgstr ""
"Det er muligt at tilpasse layoutet af siden :guilabel:`My Wishlist`. For at "
"gøre det skal du åbne hjemmesideredigeringen, mens du er på ønskelistesiden, "
"og i fanen :guilabel:`Style` under sektionen :guilabel:`Wishlist Page` vælge "
"et :guilabel:`Products Design`. Afhængigt af det valgte design skal du "
"tilpasse layoutet i henhold til :guilabel:`Desktop`- "
"eller :guilabel:`Mobile`-enheder. Klik på ikonet :icon:`fa-paint-brush` "
"(:guilabel:`paint brush`) ved siden af :guilabel:`Products Design` for at få "
"adgang til flere tilpasningsmuligheder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:97
msgid ""
"Customers can move products from their cart to their wishlist by clicking "
"the :guilabel:`Save for Later` button in the :guilabel:`Order "
"summary` :ref:`checkout step <ecommerce/checkout/review_order>`."
msgstr ""
"Kunderne kan flytte produkter fra deres kurv til deres ønskeliste ved at "
"klikke på knappen :guilabel:`Save for later` i :guilabel:`Order "
"summary` :ref:`betalingstrinnet <ecommerce/checkout/review_order>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:100
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`My Wishlist` page, customers can move products from their "
"wishlist to the cart."
msgstr ""
"På siden :guilabel:`My Wishlist` kan kunderne flytte produkter fra deres "
"ønskeliste til kurven."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:106
msgid "Product highlight"
msgstr "Fremhæv produkt"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:108
msgid ""
"The eCommerce app allows you to highlight products to increase their "
"visibility. To do so, go to :menuselection:`Website --> eCommerce --> "
"Ribbons`. You can either use one of the preconfigured ribbons "
"(:guilabel:`Sold out`, :guilabel:`Sale`, :guilabel:`Out of stock` "
"or :guilabel:`New!`) or create a :guilabel:`New` one. Add a ribbon name, and "
"select the method to :guilabel:`Assign` it:"
msgstr ""
"Webshop-appen giver dig mulighed for at fremhæve produkter for at øge deres "
"synlighed. For at gøre det skal du gå til :menuselection:`Website --> "
"eCommerce --> Product Ribbons`. Du kan enten bruge en af de prækonfigurerede "
"badges (:guilabel:`Sold out`, :guilabel:`Sale`, :guilabel:`Out of stock` "
"eller :guilabel:`New!`) eller oprette en :guilabel:`New`. Tilføj et "
"badgenavn, og vælg metoden til at :guilabel:`Assign` det:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:113
msgid ":guilabel:`Manually`: assign the ribbon manually."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Manually`: tildel badge manuelt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:114
msgid ""
":guilabel:`On Sale`: the ribbon is displayed when the product is on sale, "
"e.g., when using a :ref:`comparison price <ecommerce/prices/permanent-"
"discounts>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`On Sale`: badge vises, når produktet er på tilbud, f.eks. når der "
"bruges en :ref:`sammenligningspris <ecommerce/prices/permanent-discounts>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:116
msgid ""
":guilabel:`When New`: the ribbon is displayed when a new product is added. "
"Specify the number of :guilabel:`days after publication` it should be "
"displayed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`When New`: badge vises, når et nyt produkt tilføjes. Angiv "
"antallet af :guilabel:`days after publication`, det skal vises."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:118
msgid ""
":guilabel:`when out of stock`: the ribbon is displayed when the product is "
"currently no longer available."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`when out of stock`: badge vises, når produktet i øjeblikket ikke "
"længere er tilgængeligt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:121
msgid ""
"Choose its :guilabel:`Position`, either :guilabel:`Left` "
"or :guilabel:`Right`, and a :guilabel:`Style`, either :guilabel:`Ribbon` "
"or :guilabel:`Badge`. Define the :guilabel:`Text Color` and "
"the :guilabel:`Background Color`. Then :guilabel:`Save`. The ribbon is now "
"available for all the e-commerce products."
msgstr ""
"Vælg dens :guilabel:`Position`, enten :guilabel:`Venstre` "
"eller :guilabel:`Højre`, og en :guilabel:`Stil`, enten :guilabel:`Bånd` "
"eller :guilabel:`Badge`. Definer :guilabel:`Tekstfarve` "
"og :guilabel:`Baggrundsfarve`. Klik derefter på :guilabel:`Gem`. Båndet er "
"nu tilgængeligt for alle webshop-produkter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:126
msgid "Product with badge"
msgstr "Produkt med badge"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:130
msgid "There are other ways to create a new product ribbon:"
msgstr "Der er andre måder at oprette et nyt produktbånd:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:132
msgid ""
"Access the product form, and under the :guilabel:`eCommerce` tab, change or "
"create the ribbon in the :guilabel:`Ribbon` field."
msgstr ""
"Gå til produktformularen, og under fanen :guilabel:`e-handel`, skal du ændre "
"eller oprette båndet i feltet :guilabel:`Bånd`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:134
msgid ""
"Edit/create ribbons from the :doc:`website editor <../../website/"
"web_design>`. To do so, go to the :guilabel:`Style` tab, and navigate to "
"the :guilabel:`Product Details` section. Click the green :icon:`fa-plus` "
"(:guilabel:`Create`) icon next to the :guilabel:`Ribbon` field or "
"the :icon:`fa-pencil-square-o` (:guilabel:`Edit`) icon next to "
"the :guilabel:`Ribbon` label. The :guilabel:`Assign` feature is not "
"available for configuration in the website editor."
msgstr ""
"Rediger/opret bånd fra :doc:`hjemmesideredigeringsprogrammet <../../website/"
"web_design>`. Gå til fanen :guilabel:`Stil`, og naviger til "
"sektionen :guilabel:`Produktdetaljer`. Klik på det grønne :icon:`fa-plus` "
"(:guilabel:`Opret`) ikon ved siden af feltet :guilabel:`Bånd` "
"eller :icon:`fa-pencil-square-o` (:guilabel:`Rediger`) ikonet ved siden af "
"etiketten :guilabel:`Bånd`. Funktionen :guilabel:`Tildel` er ikke "
"tilgængelig til konfiguration i hjemmesideredigeringsprogrammet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:141
msgid "Create a new ribbon in the website editor"
msgstr "Opret nyt bånd i hjemmesideredigeringsprogrammet"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/additional_features.rst:144
msgid ""
"It is also possible to add ribbons for specific :ref:`product variants "
"<ecommerce/categories_variants/product-variants>`. To do so, go "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> eCommerce --> Products` and select a product. "
"Click the :icon:`fa-sitemap` :guilabel:`Variants` smart button, choose a "
"variant, and add a ribbon in the :guilabel:`Ribbon` field of "
"the :guilabel:`Sales` section."
msgstr ""
"Det er også muligt at tilføje bånd for specifikke :ref:`produktvarianter "
"<ecommerce/categories_variants/product-variants>`. Det gøres ved at gå til "
":menuselection:`Websted --> e-handel --> Produkter` og vælge et produkt. "
"Klik på smart-knappen :icon:`fa-sitemap` :guilabel:`Varianter`, vælg en "
"variant, og tilføj et bånd i feltet :guilabel:`Bånd` under sektionen "
":guilabel:`Salg`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:5
msgid ""
"The e-commerce catalog displays products for customers to browse. It is "
"organized using :ref:`product categories <ecommerce/categories_variants/"
"categories>`, available :ref:`product variants <ecommerce/"
"categories_variants/product-variants>`, sorting options, and navigation "
"paths. Essentially, the e-commerce catalog is the shop page of your website."
msgstr ""
"Webshop-kataloget viser produkter, som kunder kan gennemse. Det er "
"organiseret ved hjælp af :ref:`produktkategorier <ecommerce/"
"categories_variants/categories>`, tilgængelige :ref:`produktvarianter "
"<ecommerce/categories_variants/product-variants>`, sorteringsmuligheder og "
"navigationsstier. Webshop-kataloget er i bund og grund din hjemmesides "
"shopside."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:10
msgid ""
"The product catalog features a :ref:`toolbar and some filters <ecommerce/"
"catalog/toolbar-and-filters>` in the sidebar (or slide-out menu), along with "
"a dedicated :ref:`product listing area <ecommerce/catalog/product-listing>`. "
"Additionally, the shop and category pages' :ref:`layout <ecommerce/catalog/"
"customize-layout>`, as well as the :ref:`e-commerce footer <ecommerce/"
"catalog/footer>`, can be customized, and you can add :ref:`building blocks "
"<ecommerce/catalog/catalog-blocks>` as needed."
msgstr ""
"Produktkataloget har en :ref:`værktøjslinje og nogle filtre <ecommerce/"
"catalog/toolbar-and-filters>` i sidebjælken (eller slide-out-menuen) sammen "
"med et dedikeret :ref:`produktlisteområde <ecommerce/catalog/product-"
"listing>`. Derudover kan shop- og kategorisidernes :ref:`layout <ecommerce/"
"catalog/customize-layout>` samt :ref:`webshop-fodteksten <ecommerce/catalog/"
"footer>` tilpasses, og du kan tilføje :ref:`byggeblokke <ecommerce/catalog/"
"catalog-blocks>` efter behov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:17
msgid ""
"To customize the catalog, go to the shop page, click :guilabel:`Edit` in the "
"upper-right corner, select the section you want to change, and navigate to "
"the :guilabel:`Style` tab."
msgstr ""
"For at tilpasse kataloget skal du gå til shopsiden, klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Rediger` i øverste højre hjørne, vælge den sektion, du vil "
"ændre, og navigere til fanen :guilabel:`Stil`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:23
msgid "Toolbar and filters"
msgstr "Værktøjslinje og filtre"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:25
msgid ""
"The toolbar and sidebar (or slide-out menu) provide advanced filtering tools "
"to help customers search and navigate the product catalog "
"using :ref:`categories <ecommerce/catalog/categories>` and :ref:`attributes "
"<ecommerce/catalog/attributes>`."
msgstr ""
"Værktøjslinjen og sidebjælken (eller slide-out-menuen) tilbyder avancerede "
"filtreringsværktøjer, der hjælper kunder med at søge og navigere i "
"produktkataloget ved hjælp af :ref:`kategorier <ecommerce/catalog/"
"categories>` og :ref:`attributter <ecommerce/catalog/attributes>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:30
msgid ""
"If you do not want to display a toolbar or sidebar, disable all related "
"options in the website editor, :ref:`hide attributes <ecommerce/"
"categories_variants/attributes>`, and make sure to only assign one pricelist "
"to the website."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du ikke ønsker at vise en værktøjslinje eller sidebjælke, skal du "
"deaktivere alle relaterede indstillinger i hjemmesideeditoren, :ref:`skjule "
"attributter <ecommerce/categories_variants/attributes>` og sikre dig, at du "
"kun tildeler én prisliste til hjemmesiden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:37
msgid "Categories"
msgstr "Kategorier"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:39
msgid ""
"To create a :ref:`category <ecommerce/categories_variants/categories>` quick "
"access in the toolbar or general access in the sidebar, click "
"the :guilabel:`Top` and/or :guilabel:`Sidebar` button next "
"to :guilabel:`Categories`, and choose a :guilabel:`Style` for them. When "
"the :guilabel:`Sidebar` is selected, the option :guilabel:`Collapse Category "
"Recursive` appears, allowing you to collapse the category in the sidebar."
msgstr ""
"For at oprette en :ref:`kategori <ecommerce/categories_variants/categories>`-"
"genvej i værktøjslinjen eller generel adgang i sidebjælken skal du klikke på "
"knappen :guilabel:`Top` og/eller :guilabel:`Sidebjælke` ved siden "
"af :guilabel:`Kategorier` og vælge en :guilabel:`Stil` til dem. "
"Når :guilabel:`Sidebjælke` er valgt, vises indstillingen :guilabel:`Fold "
"kategori rekursivt sammen`, som giver dig mulighed for at folde kategorien "
"sammen i sidebjælken."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:49
msgid ""
"The category filters located in the sidebar are not affected by "
"the :guilabel:`Filters` setting."
msgstr ""
"Kategorifiltrene i sidebjælken påvirkes ikke af "
"indstillingen :guilabel:`Filtre`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:54
msgid "Toolbar"
msgstr "Værktøjslinje"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:56
msgid ""
"It is possible to display a search bar, sort-by options or a date selector "
"for :doc:`rental products <../../../sales/rental>` in the toolbar of the "
"shop page by clicking the :guilabel:`Sort By`, :guilabel:`Search` and/"
"or :guilabel:`Rental` buttons next to the :guilabel:`Toolbar` label. Toggle "
"the :guilabel:`Floating` switch on to always display the search bar, "
"the :ref:`pricelist selector <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` (if any), and "
"sort-by options at the bottom of the window, even when scrolling, and select "
"a :guilabel:`Default Sort` option."
msgstr ""
"Det er muligt at vise en søgelinje, sorteringsmuligheder eller en datovælger "
"for :doc:`udlejningsprodukter <../../../sales/rental>` i værktøjslinjen på "
"butikssiden ved at klikke på knapperne :guilabel:`Sortér efter`, "
":guilabel:`Søg` og/eller :guilabel:`Udlejning` ved siden af etiketten "
":guilabel:`Værktøjslinje`. Slå kontakten :guilabel:`Flydende` til for altid "
"at vise søgelinjen, :ref:`prislister <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>` (hvis "
"nogen) og sorteringsmuligheder nederst i vinduet, selv når der rulles, og "
"vælg en indstilling for :guilabel:`Standard sortering`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:64
msgid ""
"The default sort applies to *all* :ref:`categories <ecommerce/"
"categories_variants/categories>`."
msgstr ""
"Standardsorteringen gælder for *alle* :ref:`kategorier <ecommerce/"
"categories_variants/categories>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:69
msgid "Filters"
msgstr "Filtre"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:71
msgid "Set the :guilabel:`Filters` field to:"
msgstr "Indstil feltet :guilabel:`Filtre` til:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:73
msgid ":guilabel:`Sidebar`: to display filters in the side panel;"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Sidepanel`: viser filtre i sidepanelet;"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:74
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Off-screen menu`: to display filters in a slide-out menu that "
"opens when clicking the :icon:`fa-sliders` :guilabel:`Filters` button in the "
"toolbar;"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Off-screen menu`: viser filtre i en slide-ud menu, der åbnes ved "
"klik på :icon:`fa-sliders` :guilabel:`Filtre` knappen i værktøjslinjen;"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:76
msgid ":guilabel:`Hide`: to hide filters entirely."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Skjul`: skjuler filtre helt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:78
msgid "By default, two :guilabel:`Filters` are enabled:"
msgstr "Som standard er to :guilabel:`Filtre` aktiveret:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:80
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Price`: Use the switch to display a :guilabel:`Price Range` bar, "
"which allows customers to filter products according to a specific price "
"range by dragging adjustable handles."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Pris`: Brug kontakten til at vise en :guilabel:`Prisinterval` "
"bjælke, som giver kunder mulighed for at filtrere produkter efter et "
"specifikt prisinterval ved at trække justerbare håndtag."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:83
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tags`: Toggle the switch to display product :guilabel:`Tags` on "
"the shop page, and allow customers to filter products using those tags by "
"going to the :guilabel:`Tags` section."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tags`: Slå kontakten til for at vise produkt :guilabel:`Tags` på "
"shopsiden og tillade kunder at filtrere produkter ved hjælp af disse tags "
"ved at gå til sektionen :guilabel:`Tags`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:87
msgid ""
"To create product tags on your e-commerce, go to :menuselection:`Website --> "
"eCommerce --> Products`, and select the product you want to create a tag "
"for. On the product form, navigate to the :guilabel:`eCommerce` tab, then, "
"in the :guilabel:`Tags` field, select a tag or :guilabel:`Create and edit` "
"one. On the :guilabel:`Create Tags` pop-up, add a :guilabel:`Tag` name, "
"toggle the :guilabel:`Visible to customers` switch on/off, and select "
"a :guilabel:`Color`. Optionally, add an image. Then go to the product form, "
"and assign the relevant tags where needed."
msgstr ""
"For at oprette produktkategorier i din e-handel skal du gå til "
":menuselection:`Websted --> e-handel --> Produkter` og vælge det produkt, du "
"vil oprette et tag for. På produktformularen skal du navigere til fanen "
":guilabel:`E-handel`, derefter i feltet :guilabel:`Tags` skal du vælge et "
"tag eller :guilabel:`Opret og redigér` et. I pop op-vinduet :guilabel:`Opret "
"Tags` skal du tilføje et :guilabel:`Tag`-navn, slå kontakten "
":guilabel:`Synlig for kunder` til/fra og vælge en :guilabel:`Farve`. Tilføj "
"eventuelt et billede. Gå derefter til produktformularen og tildel de "
"relevante tags, hvor det er nødvendigt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:100
msgid ""
"When you offer :ref:`product variants <ecommerce/categories_variants/product-"
"variants>` with different :ref:`attributes <ecommerce/categories_variants/"
"attributes>`, those options appear in the sidebar or slide-out menu when "
"filters are shown. The menu automatically adapts to the number of attribute "
"sections:"
msgstr ""
"Når du tilbyder :ref:`produktvarianter <ecommerce/categories_variants/"
"product-variants>` med forskellige :ref:`attributter <ecommerce/"
"categories_variants/attributes>`, vises disse muligheder i sidepanelet eller "
"slide-ud menuen, når filtre er vist. Menuen tilpasser sig automatisk til "
"antallet af attributsektioner:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:105
msgid "**Up to 4 attributes**: all the attribute values are displayed."
msgstr "**Op til 4 attributter**: alle attributværdierne vises."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:106
msgid "**More than 4 attributes**: the sections are automatically collapsed."
msgstr "**Mere end 4 attributter**: sektionerne er automatisk skjult."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:109
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`Radio` and :guilabel:`Select` :ref:`display types <products/"
"variants/attributes>`, a :guilabel:`View More` button appears when there are "
"more than **8** values, and a search field when the number of values exceeds "
"**20**."
msgstr ""
"For :guilabel:`Radio` og :guilabel:`Vælg` :ref:`visningstyper <products/"
"variants/attributes>` vises en :guilabel:`Vis mere` knap, når der er mere "
"end **8** værdier, og et søgefelt når antallet af værdier overstiger **20**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/ecommerce_design/catalog.rst:112
