#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/order_handling.rst:5
msgid ""
"In Odoo's e-commerce workflow, an online purchase typically goes through "
"three main steps: :ref:`sale <ecommerce/handling/sales>`, :ref:`delivery "
"<ecommerce/handling/delivery>`, and :ref:`invoicing <ecommerce/handling/"
"invoices>`. Each step generates key documents, including sales orders upon "
"order confirmation, delivery orders to manage :doc:`picking </applications/"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"picking_methods>`, :doc:`packing </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/multipack>`, and :doc:`shipping "
"<shipping>`, and invoices. Odoo eCommerce also offers additional tools for "
"sending :ref:`abandoned cart emails <ecommerce/handling/abandoned_cart>`, "
"ensuring :ref:`stock availability <ecommerce/handling/stock-management>`, "
"and handling product :ref:`returns and refunds <ecommerce/handling/returns>`."
msgstr ""
"I Odoos e-handelsarbejdsgang gennemgår et onlinekøb typisk tre "
"hovedtrin: :ref:`salg <ecommerce/handling/sales>`, :ref:`levering <ecommerce/"
"handling/delivery>` og :ref:`fakturering <ecommerce/handling/invoices>`. "
"Hvert trin genererer vigtige dokumenter, herunder salgsordrer ved "
"ordrebekræftelse, leveringsordrer til håndtering af :doc:`plukning </"
"applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/"
"picking_methods>`, :doc:`pakning </applications/inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"shipping_receiving/setup_configuration/multipack>` og :doc:`forsendelse "
"<shipping>` samt fakturaer. Odoo eCommerce tilbyder også yderligere "
"værktøjer til at sende :ref:`e-mails om forladte indkøbskurve <ecommerce/"
"handling/abandoned_cart>`, sikre :ref:`lagertilgængelighed <ecommerce/"
"handling/stock-management>` og håndtere :ref:`returneringer og refunderinger "
"<ecommerce/handling/returns>` af produkter."

