"many :guilabel:`days after delivery` customers can return products, and "
"click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"For at give kunder mulighed for at oprette :doc:`returneringer </"
"applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns>` via :doc:`kundeportalen </"
"applications/general/users/user_portals>` skal du gå "
"til :menuselection:`Lager --> Konfiguration --> Indstillinger`, rulle ned "
"til sektionen :guilabel:`Operationer` og aktivere :guilabel:`Tillad spontane "
"returneringer`. Angiv derefter, hvor mange :guilabel:`dage efter levering` "
