#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/payments.rst:15
msgid ""
"The payment options displayed at :ref:`checkout <ecommerce/checkout/steps>` "
"depend on the :ref:`active payment providers <payment_providers/add_new>`, "
"the enabled :ref:`payment methods <payment_providers/payment_methods>`, "
"the :ref:`availability options <payment_providers/availability>` set for the "
"provider, the :ref:`customer's country and currency <payment_providers/"
"currencies_countries>`, and the :doc:`delivery method <shipping>` selected "
"by the customer."
msgstr ""
"De betalingsmuligheder, der vises ved :ref:`kassen <ecommerce/checkout/"
"steps>`, afhænger af de :ref:`aktive betalingsudbydere <payment_providers/"
"add_new>`, de aktiverede :ref:`betalingsmetoder <payment_providers/"
"payment_methods>`, :ref:`tilgængelighedsindstillingerne <payment_providers/"
"availability>` angivet for udbyderen, :ref:`kundens land og valuta "
"<payment_providers/currencies_countries>` samt den :doc:`leveringsmetode "
"<shipping>`, der er valgt af kunden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/payments.rst:23
msgid "Payment providers"
msgstr "Betalingsudbydere"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/payments.rst:25
msgid ""
"Several :ref:`payment providers are supported <payment_providers/"
"supported_providers>`. Each provider supports a specific list "
"of :ref:`countries and currencies <payment_providers/currencies_countries>` "
"and offers specific :ref:`payment methods <payment_providers/"
"payment_methods>`, which can be individually (de)activated to match business "
"requirements."
msgstr ""
"Flere :ref:`betalingsudbydere understøttes <payment_providers/"
"supported_providers>`. Hver udbyder understøtter en specifik liste "
"over :ref:`lande og valutaer <payment_providers/currencies_countries>` og "
"tilbyder specifikke :ref:`betalingsmetoder <payment_providers/"
"payment_methods>`, som kan (de)aktiveres individuelt for at matche "
"virksomhedens behov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/payments.rst:31
msgid ""
"To make a payment provider's payment methods available to customers "
"at :ref:`checkout <ecommerce/checkout/payment>`, go "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> "
"Payments`, :guilabel:`Install` the relevant provider, :ref:`configure it, "
"and publish it <payment_providers/add_new>`."
msgstr ""
"For at gøre en betalingsudbyders betalingsmetoder tilgængelige for kunder "
"ved :ref:`kassen <ecommerce/checkout/payment>` skal du gå "
"til :menuselection:`Websted --> Konfiguration --> "
"Betalinger`, :guilabel:`installere` den relevante udbyder, :ref:`konfigurere "
"den og udgive den <payment_providers/add_new>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/payments.rst:39
msgid "Pay on site"
msgstr "Betal i butikken"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/payments.rst:41
msgid ""
"To allow customers to reserve products online and pay when collecting them "
"in-store, enable and configure the :ref:`Click & Collect feature <ecommerce/"
"shipping/instore-pickup>`. The :guilabel:`Pay on Site` payment provider is "
"then automatically installed and published."
msgstr ""
"For at give kunder mulighed for at reservere produkter online og betale, når "
"de afhenter dem i butikken, skal du aktivere og konfigurere :ref:`Click & "
"Collect-funktionen <ecommerce/shipping/instore-pickup>`. "
"Betalingsudbyderen :guilabel:`Betal på stedet` installeres og udgives "
"derefter automatisk."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/payments.rst:46
msgid ""
"This payment method is available at checkout only for customers who select "
"the :guilabel:`Pick up in store` delivery method."
msgstr ""
"Denne betalingsmetode er kun tilgængelig ved kassen for kunder, der vælger "
"leveringsmetoden :guilabel:`Afhent i butik`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/payments.rst:52
msgid "Cash on delivery"
msgstr "Efterkrav"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/payments.rst:54
