"Payments` and select the :guilabel:`Pay on Invoice` payment provider. "
"Then, :ref:`restrict its availability <payment_providers/availability>` if "
"needed (e.g., by selecting a B2B-specific :ref:`pricelist <ecommerce/prices/"
"pricelists>`) and :ref:`publish it <payment_providers/add_new>`."
msgstr ""
"For at konfigurere den skal du gå til :menuselection:`Websted --> "
"Konfiguration --> Betalinger` og vælge betalingsudbyderen :guilabel:`Betal "
"via faktura`. Derefter kan du om nødvendigt :ref:`begrænse dens "
"tilgængelighed <payment_providers/availability>` (f.eks. ved at vælge en B2B-"
"specifik :ref:`prisliste <ecommerce/prices/pricelists>`) "
"og :ref:`offentliggøre den <payment_providers/add_new>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/ecommerce/payments.rst:80
