"automatisk og **kan ikke** redigeres eller slettes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:72
msgid ""
":guilabel:`CNAME`: CNAME records forward one domain or subdomain to another "
"domain. One is automatically created to map the `www` subdomain to the "
"database. If the database is renamed, the CNAME record **must** be updated "
"accordingly."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`CNAME`: CNAME-poster videresender et domæne eller underdomæne til "
"et andet domæne. Der oprettes automatisk én for at knytte underdomænet `www` "
"til databasen. Hvis databasen omdøbes, **skal** CNAME-posten opdateres "
"tilsvarende."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:75
msgid ":guilabel:`MX`: MX records instruct servers on where to deliver emails."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`MX`: MX-poster instruerer servere om, hvor e-mails skal leveres."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:76
msgid ""
":guilabel:`TXT`: TXT records can be used for various purposes (e.g., "
"verifying domain name ownership)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`TXT`: TXT-poster kan bruges til forskellige formål (f.eks. "
"verificering af domænenavnsejerskab)."

