"oversat. Indhold, som du har tilføjet manuelt, bør dog oversættes ved hjælp "
"af funktionen :guilabel:`Oversæt`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/translate.rst:84
msgid ""
"When text is highlighted in green, it indicates that it has already been "
"translated (manually or automatically). When text is highlighted in yellow, "
"it indicates that it has not been translated."
msgstr ""
"Når tekst er fremhævet med grønt, indikerer det, at den allerede er blevet "
"oversat (manuelt eller automatisk). Når tekst er fremhævet med gult, "
"indikerer det, at den ikke er blevet oversat."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/translate.rst:88
msgid ""
"Click the green button next to the :guilabel:`Translated to` field to "
"automatically translate all text highlighted in yellow. You can also "
"manually translate or adapt text, whether it is highlighted in green or "
"yellow, by selecting it and editing it. Click :guilabel:`Save` when you are "
"done translating."
msgstr ""
"Klik på den grønne knap ved siden af feltet :guilabel:`Oversat til` for "
"automatisk at oversætte al tekst, der er fremhævet med gult. Du kan også "
"manuelt oversætte eller tilpasse tekst, uanset om den er fremhævet med grønt "
"eller gult, ved at markere den og redigere den. Klik på :guilabel:`Gem`, når "
"du er færdig med at oversætte."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/translate.rst:93
msgid "Entering the translation mode"
msgstr "Start af oversættelsestilstand"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/translate.rst:97
msgid ""
"The core URL structure remains consistent across languages, while specific "
"elements like product names or categories are translated. For example, "
"`https://www.mywebsite.com/shop/product/my-product-1` is the default version "
"of a product page, while `https://www.mywebsite.com/fr/shop/product/mon-"
"produit-1` is the translated version of the same product page. The structure "
"(`/shop/product/`) remains unchanged, but the product name (`my-product`) is "
"translated (`mon-produit`)."
msgstr ""
"Kernens URL-struktur forbliver konsistent på tværs af sprog, mens specifikke "
"elementer som produktnavne eller kategorier oversættes. For eksempel er "
"`https://www.mywebsite.com/shop/product/my-product-1` standardversionen af "
"en produktside, mens `https://www.mywebsite.com/fr/shop/product/mon-"
"produit-1` er den oversatte version af samme produktside. Strukturen (`/shop/"
"product/`) forbliver uændret, men produktnavnet (`my-product`) oversættes "
"(`mon-produit`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/translate.rst:103
msgid ""
"Some elements can also be translated from the backend (e.g., product names)."
msgstr "Nogle elementer kan også oversættes fra backend (f.eks. produktnavne)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/translate.rst:106
msgid "Translate SEO-related elements"
msgstr "Oversæt SEO-relaterede elementer"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/translate.rst:108
msgid ""
"To translate an :ref:`image's alt tag <seo/images>` (i.e., the "
"image's :guilabel:`Description` field) and title tag (i.e., the "
"image's :guilabel:`Tooltip` field), switch to the language to translate, "
"click :menuselection:`Edit --> Translate`, and select the image. In "
"the :guilabel:`Translate Attribute` box, enter the translation for "
"the :guilabel:`alt` and/or the :guilabel:`title` tags."
msgstr ""
"For at oversætte et :ref:`billedes alt-tag <seo/images>` (dvs. billedets "
"felt :guilabel:`Beskrivelse`) og title-tag (dvs. billedets "
"felt :guilabel:`Værktøjstip`), skift til det sprog, der skal oversættes, "
"klik på :menuselection:`Rediger --> Oversæt`, og vælg billedet. I "
"boksen :guilabel:`Oversæt attribut` skal du indtaste oversættelsen "
"for :guilabel:`alt`- og/eller :guilabel:`title`-tags."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/translate.rst:114
msgid ""
"To add translated :ref:`meta tags <seo/meta-tags>`, go "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> Site --> Optimize SEO`. In "
"the :guilabel:`Keywords` section, select the language and add the keywords."
msgstr ""
"For at tilføje oversatte :ref:`meta-tags <seo/meta-tags>`, gå "
"til :menuselection:`Hjemmeside --> Websted --> Optimer SEO`. I "
"afsnittet :guilabel:`Nøgleord` skal du vælge sproget og tilføje nøgleordene."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/translate.rst:118
msgid ""
"When viewing a website in its default language, all keywords are displayed, "
"regardless of their language. However, when viewing a website in another "
"language, only the keywords relevant to that language are displayed."
msgstr ""
"Når du ser en hjemmeside på dens standardsprog, vises alle nøgleord, uanset "
"deres sprog. Når du ser en hjemmeside på et andet sprog, vises kun de "
"nøgleord, der er relevante for det pågældende sprog."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/configuration/translate.rst:123
msgid ":doc:`Search Engine Optimization <../structure/seo>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Søgemaskineoptimering <../structure/seo>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:5
msgid ""
"The **mail groups** feature allows website visitors to have a public "
"discussion by email. They can join a group to receive emails from other "
"group members (i.e., website users who have subscribed to the group) and "
"send new ones to all group members."
msgstr ""
"Funktionen **e-mailgrupper** giver besøgende på hjemmesiden mulighed for at "
"føre offentlige diskussioner via e-mail. De kan tilmelde sig en gruppe for "
"at modtage e-mails fra andre gruppemedlemmer (dvs. brugere af hjemmesiden, "
"der har abonneret på gruppen) og sende nye e-mails til alle gruppemedlemmer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:9
msgid ""
"To activate the feature, :ref:`install <general/install>` "
"the :guilabel:`Website Mail Group` (`website_mail_group`) module."
msgstr ""
"For at aktivere funktionen skal du :ref:`installere <general/install>` "
"modulet :guilabel:`Website Mail Group` (`website_mail_group`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:13
msgid ""
"The **mail groups** feature is not to be confused with the :doc:`../../"
"marketing/email_marketing/mailing_lists` in the Email Marketing app."
msgstr ""
"Funktionen **e-mailgrupper** må ikke forveksles med :doc:`../../marketing/"
"email_marketing/mailing_lists` i appen E-mailmarketing."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:19
msgid "Configuring mail groups"
msgstr "Konfigurering af e-mailgrupper"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:21
msgid "To configure mail groups, proceed as follows:"
msgstr "Gør følgende for at konfigurere e-mailgrupper:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:23
msgid ""
"Configure a custom email alias domain by accessing the **General settings**, "
"scrolling down to the :guilabel:`Discuss` section, enabling "
"the :guilabel:`Custom Email Server` feature, and entering "
"the :guilabel:`Alias domain` (e.g., `@mycompany.com`)."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurer et brugerdefineret e-mailaliasdomæne ved at gå til **Generelle "
"indstillinger**, rulle ned til sektionen :guilabel:`Beskeder`, aktivere "
"funktionen :guilabel:`Custom Email Server` og indtaste :guilabel:`Alias "
"domain` (f.eks. `@mitfirma.com`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:26
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Mailing Lists`, then "
"click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"Gå til :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Mailing Lists`, og klik "
"derefter på :guilabel:`New`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:27
msgid ""
"Specify a :guilabel:`Group Name`, the :guilabel:`Email Alias`, and "
"a :guilabel:`Description`."
msgstr ""
"Angiv et :guilabel:`Group Name`, :guilabel:`Email Alias` og "
"en :guilabel:`Description`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:28
msgid ""
"Enable :guilabel:`Moderate this group` and specify "
"the :guilabel:`Moderators` if you wish to :ref:`moderate messages <website/"
"mailing_lists/moderate>` from this group. Alternatively, if the group is not "
"moderated, you can define :guilabel:`Responsible Users` who can manage the "
"messages in the group."
msgstr ""
"Aktivér :guilabel:`Moderate this group`, og angiv :guilabel:`Moderators`, "
"hvis du ønsker at :ref:`moderere meddelelser <website/mailing_lists/"
"moderate>` fra denne gruppe. Hvis gruppen ikke modereres, kan du alternativt "
"definere :guilabel:`Responsible Users`, som kan administrere meddelelserne i "
"gruppen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:32
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Privacy` tab, define who can subscribe to the mail group:"
msgstr ""
"I fanen :guilabel:`Privacy` skal du definere, hvem der kan abonnere på e-"
"mailgruppen:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:34
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Everyone`: to make the mail group public so anyone can subscribe "
"to it;"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Everyone`: for at gøre e-mailgruppen offentlig, så alle kan "
"abonnere på den;"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:35
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Members only`: to only allow users defined as members to "
"subscribe to the mail group;"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Members only`: for kun at tillade brugere defineret som medlemmer "
"at abonnere på e-mailgruppen;"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:36
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Selected group of users`: to only allow users from "
"the :guilabel:`Authorized group` to subscribe to the mail group."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Selected group of users`: for kun at tillade brugere "
"fra :guilabel:`Authorized group` at abonnere på e-mailgruppen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:39
msgid ""
"If the mail group is moderated, you can automatically notify authors when "
"their message is pending moderation by enabling :guilabel:`Automatic "
"notification` in the :guilabel:`Notify Members` tab and writing "
"the :guilabel:`Notification message`."
msgstr ""
"Hvis e-mailgruppen modereres, kan du automatisk underrette forfattere, når "
"deres meddelelse afventer moderation, ved at aktivere :guilabel:`Automatic "
"notification` i fanen :guilabel:`Notify Members` og "
"skrive :guilabel:`Notification message`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:42
msgid ""
"If you wish to send out guidelines to new subscribers, "
"enable :guilabel:`Send guidelines to new subscribers` and write them in "
"the :guilabel:`Guidelines` tab. This is particularly useful when the mail "
"group is moderated."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du ønsker at sende retningslinjer til nye abonnenter, skal du "
"aktivere :guilabel:`Send guidelines to new subscribers` og skrive dem i "
"fanen :guilabel:`Guidelines`. Dette er særligt nyttigt, når e-mailgruppen "
"modereres."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:47
msgid "Using mail groups"
msgstr "Brug af mailgrupper"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:50
msgid "Subscribing/unsubscribing"
msgstr "Tilmelding/afmelding"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:52
msgid ""
"Based on the :ref:`configuration of the mail group <website/mailing_lists/"
"configure_groups>`, users can subscribe to and unsubscribe from mail groups "
"from the website page (`/groups` by default)."
msgstr ""
"Baseret på :ref:`konfigurationen af mailgruppen <website/mailing_lists/"
"configure_groups>` kan brugere tilmelde og afmelde sig mailgrupper fra "
"hjemmesidens side (`/groups` som standard)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:55
msgid "Mail group web page."
msgstr "Mailgruppens webside."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:58
msgid ""
"Internal users can also do this from :menuselection:`Website --> "
"Configuration --> Mailing Lists`, using the :guilabel:`Join` "
"and :guilabel:`Leave` buttons."
msgstr ""
"Interne brugere kan også gøre dette fra :menuselection:`Hjemmeside --> "
"Konfiguration --> Mailinglister` ved hjælp af knapperne :guilabel:`Tilmeld` "
"og :guilabel:`Forlad`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:62
msgid "Sending messages"
msgstr "Sender beskeder"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:64
msgid ""
"To send messages to a mail group, website users can email the :ref:`mail "
"group's email address <website/mailing_lists/configure_groups>`. Internal "
"users can also create messages directly from Odoo. To do so, go "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Mailing Lists`, select the "
"mail group, click the :guilabel:`Emails` smart button, and "
"click :guilabel:`New`. Then, fill in the fields and click :guilabel:`Send`."
msgstr ""
"For at sende beskeder til en mailgruppe kan hjemmesidebrugere sende en e-"
"mail til :ref:`mailgruppens e-mailadresse <website/mailing_lists/"
"configure_groups>`. Interne brugere kan også oprette beskeder direkte fra "
"Odoo. Gå til :menuselection:`Hjemmeside --> Konfiguration --> "
"Mailinglister`, vælg mailgruppen, klik på smartknappen :guilabel:`E-mails`, "
"og klik på :guilabel:`Ny`. Udfyld derefter felterne og klik "
"på :guilabel:`Send`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:71
msgid ""
"The list of messages can also be accessed by selecting the group from the `/"
"groups` website page."
msgstr ""
"Listen over beskeder kan også tilgås ved at vælge gruppen fra hjemmesidens `/"
"groups`-side."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:73
msgid ""
"Group members can also unsubscribe from the group, access the mail group "
"page, and send emails to the group using the URLs in the footer of any group "
"email they have received."
msgstr ""
"Gruppemedlemmer kan også afmelde sig gruppen, få adgang til mailgruppesiden "
"og sende e-mails til gruppen ved hjælp af URL'erne i sidefoden på enhver "
"gruppe-e-mail, de har modtaget."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:76
msgid "URLs in the footer of a group email."
msgstr "URL'er i sidefoden af en gruppe-e-mail."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:82
msgid "Moderating mail group messages"
msgstr "Moderering af mailgruppemeddelelser"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:84
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Moderate this group` feature has been enabled for "
"the :ref:`mail group <website/mailing_lists/configure_groups>`, one of "
"the :guilabel:`Moderators` must approve the group's messages before they are "
"dispatched to the other members."
msgstr ""
"Hvis funktionen :guilabel:`Moderer denne gruppe` er blevet aktiveret "
"for :ref:`mailgruppen <website/mailing_lists/configure_groups>`, skal en "
"af :guilabel:`Moderatorerne` godkende gruppens beskeder, før de sendes til "
"de andre medlemmer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:88
msgid ""
"To moderate messages, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> "
"Mailing Lists`, select the mail group, and click the :guilabel:`To review` "
"smart button. You can moderate messages using the buttons at the end of the "
"message line or select a message to view its content and moderate it "
"accordingly."
msgstr ""
"For at moderere beskeder skal du gå til :menuselection:`Hjemmeside --> "
"Konfiguration --> Mailinglister`, vælge mailgruppen og klikke på "
"smartknappen :guilabel:`Til gennemgang`. Du kan moderere beskeder ved hjælp "
"af knapperne i slutningen af beskedlinjen eller vælge en besked for at se "
"dens indhold og moderere den tilsvarende."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:93
msgid "Moderation buttons in the message line."
msgstr "Modereringsknapper i beskedlinjen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:96
msgid "The following actions are available:"
msgstr "Følgende handlinger er tilgængelige:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:98
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Accept`: to accept the email and send it to the mail group "
"members."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Acceptér`: for at acceptere e-mailen og sende den til "
"mailgruppemedlemmerne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:99
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Reject`: to reject the email. In the pop-up window that opens, "
"click :guilabel:`Reject Silently` to reject the email without notifying the "
"author, or specify an explanation for rejecting the message, then "
"click :guilabel:`Send & Reject` to reject the message and send the "
"explanation to the author."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Afvis`: for at afvise e-mailen. I pop op-vinduet der åbnes, skal "
"du klikke på :guilabel:`Afvis lydløst` for at afvise e-mailen uden at "
"underrette forfatteren, eller angive en forklaring på afvisningen af "
"beskeden og derefter klikke på :guilabel:`Send & afvis` for at afvise "
"beskeden og sende forklaringen til forfatteren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:103
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Whitelist`: to whitelist the author, i.e. automatically accept "
"all of their emails. As a result, a :ref:`moderation rule <website/"
"mailing_lists/moderate>` is created for the author's email address with the "
"status :guilabel:`Always allow`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Hvidlist`: for at hvidliste forfatteren, dvs. automatisk "
"acceptere alle deres e-mails. Som resultat oprettes "
"en :ref:`modereringsregel <website/mailing_lists/moderate>` for forfatterens "
"e-mailadresse med status :guilabel:`Tillad altid`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:106
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Ban`: to blacklist the author, i.e. automatically discard all "
"their emails. In the pop-up window that opens, click :guilabel:`Ban` to ban "
"the author without notifying them, or specify an explanation, then "
"click :guilabel:`Send & Ban` to ban the author and send them the "
"explanation. As a result, a :ref:`moderation rule <website/mailing_lists/"
"moderate>` is created for the author's email address with the "
"status :guilabel:`Permanent ban`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Bandlys`: for at sortliste forfatteren, dvs. automatisk kassere "
"alle deres e-mails. I pop op-vinduet der åbnes, skal du klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Bandlys` for at bandlyse forfatteren uden at underrette dem, "
"eller angive en forklaring og derefter klikke på :guilabel:`Send & bandlys` "
"for at bandlyse forfatteren og sende dem forklaringen. Som resultat oprettes "
"en :ref:`modereringsregel <website/mailing_lists/moderate>` for forfatterens "
"e-mailadresse med status :guilabel:`Permanent bandlysning`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:113
msgid ""
"Messages can also be moderated from the group's list of messages. Go "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> Groups --> Mailing List Groups`, select the "
"mail group and click the :guilabel:`Emails` smart button."
msgstr ""
"Beskeder kan også modereres fra gruppens liste over beskeder. Gå "
"til :menuselection:`Hjemmeside --> Grupper --> Mailinglistegrupper`, vælg "
"mailgruppen og klik på smartknappen :guilabel:`E-mails`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:120
msgid "Whitelisting/Blacklisting authors"
msgstr "Hvidlistning/sortlistning af forfattere"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:122
msgid ""
"You can whitelist or blacklist an author either directly :ref:`from a mail "
"group message <website/mailing_lists/moderate>`, or by creating a moderation "
"rule. To do so, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> "
"Moderation Rules` and click :guilabel:`New`. Then, select "
"the :guilabel:`Group`, specify the author's :guilabel:`Email` and set "
"the :guilabel:`Status` field."
msgstr ""
"Můžete přidat autora na whitelist nebo blacklist buď přímo :ref:`ze zprávy "
"mailové skupiny <website/mailing_lists/moderate>`, nebo vytvořením "
"moderačního pravidla. Chcete-li tak učinit, přejděte "
"na :menuselection:`Hjemmeside --> Configuration --> Moderation Rules` a "
"klikněte na :guilabel:`New`. Poté vyberte :guilabel:`Group`, zadejte "
"autorův :guilabel:`Email` a nastavte pole :guilabel:`Status`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:129
msgid ""
"You can also access the mail group's moderation rules by going "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Mailing Lists`, selecting "
"the group, then clicking the :guilabel:`Moderations` smart button."
msgstr ""
"K moderačním pravidlům mailové skupiny můžete také přistupovat tak, že "
"přejdete na :menuselection:`Hjemmeside --> Configuration --> Mailing Lists`, "
"vyberete skupinu a poté kliknete na chytré tlačítko :guilabel:`Moderations`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:3
msgid "Website analytics"
msgstr "Analytika hjemmesiden"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:5
msgid ""
"Website analytics helps website owners monitor how people use their site. It "
"provides data on visitor demographics, behavior, and interactions, helping "
"improve websites and marketing strategies."
msgstr ""
"Analytika hjemmesiden pomáhá vlastníkům webových stránek sledovat, jak lidé "
"jejich stránky používají. Poskytuje data o demografii návštěvníků, chování a "
"interakcích, což pomáhá vylepšovat webové stránky a marketingové strategie."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:8
msgid ""
"You can track your Odoo website's traffic using :ref:`analytics/plausible` "
"or :ref:`analytics/google-analytics`. We recommend using Plausible.io as it "
"is privacy-friendly, lightweight, and easy to use."
msgstr ""
"Provoz své Odoo hjemmesiden můžete sledovat pomocí :ref:`analytics/"
"plausible` nebo :ref:`analytics/google-analytics`. Doporučujeme používat "
"Plausible.io, protože je přátelský k soukromí, lehký a snadno použitelný."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:15
msgid "Plausible.io"
msgstr "Plausible.io"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:17
msgid ""
"Odoo hosts its own Plausible.io server, and the Plausible Analytics "
"dashboard is integrated into Odoo and can be accessed "
"via :menuselection:`Website --> Reporting --> Analytics`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo hoster sin egen Plausible.io-server, og Plausible Analytics-dashboardet "
"er integreret i Odoo og kan tilgås via :menuselection:`Websted --> "
"Rapportering --> Analytics`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:20
msgid ""
"Databases hosted on Odoo Online benefit from a free, ready-to-use "
"Plausible.io solution with automatically generated credentials and a "
"preconfigured Plausible account. To enable it, go to :menuselection:`Website "
"--> Configuration --> Settings`, then, in the :guilabel:`Tracking & SEO` "
"section, enable :guilabel:`Plausible Analytics`, and click :guilabel:`Save`. "
"The credentials are automatically filled in the :guilabel:`Shared Link Auth` "
"and the :guilabel:`Site` fields."
msgstr ""
"Databaser, der hostes på Odoo Online, drager fordel af en gratis, brugsklar "
"Plausible.io-løsning med automatisk genererede legitimationsoplysninger og "
"en forudkonfigureret Plausible-konto. For at aktivere den skal du gå "
"til :menuselection:`Websted --> Konfiguration --> Indstillinger`, og "
"derefter i sektionen :guilabel:`Sporing og SEO` "
"aktivere :guilabel:`Plausible Analytics` og klikke på :guilabel:`Gem`. "
"Legitimationsoplysningerne udfyldes automatisk i felterne :guilabel:`Shared "
"Link Auth` og :guilabel:`Websted`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:27
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`See Analytics Report` link to "
"open the corresponding report."
msgstr ""
"Klik på linket :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Se analyserapport` for at "
"åbne den tilhørende rapport."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:31
msgid ""
"**If you already have a Plausible.io account** and you want to connect it to "
"your Odoo Online database, you must create two `ir.config.parameters` to use "
"Plausible.io's servers. To do so, enable the :ref:`developer mode <developer-"
"mode>` and go to :menuselection:`General Settings --> Technical --> System "
"Parameters`. Click :guilabel:`New` and fill in the following :guilabel:`Key` "
"and :guilabel:`Value` fields:"
msgstr ""
"**Pokud již máte účet na Plausible.io** a chcete jej připojit ke své Odoo "
"Online database, musíte vytvořit dva `ir.config.parameters` pro použití "
"serverů Plausible.io. Chcete-li tak učinit, aktivujte :ref:`režim vývojáře "
"<developer-mode>` a přejděte na :menuselection:`General Settings --> "
"Technical --> System Parameters`. Klikněte na :guilabel:`Nový` a vyplňte "
"následující pole :guilabel:`Klíč` a :guilabel:`Hodnota`:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:40
msgid "Key"
msgstr "Nøgle"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:41
msgid "Value"
msgstr "Værdi"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:42
msgid "`website.plausible_script`"
msgstr "`website.plausible_script`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:43
msgid "`https://plausible.io/js/plausible.js`"
msgstr "`https://plausible.io/js/plausible.js`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:44
msgid "`website.plausible_server`"
msgstr "`website.plausible_server`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:45
msgid "`https://plausible.io`"
msgstr "`https://plausible.io`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:47
msgid ""
"Then, go to the Plausible website and follow the steps to :ref:`set up your "
"account <analytics/account-setting>` and link it to your Odoo database."
msgstr ""
"Gå derefter til Plausible-hjemmesiden og følg trinene for at :ref:`oprette "
"din konto <analytics/account-setting>` og knytte den til din Odoo-database."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:51
msgid ""
"Deactivating the free Plausible.io account linked to your **Odoo Online** "
"database will also remove the existing keys. As a result, new keys will be "
"generated, while all historical data will remain associated with the old "
"keys. If you plan to deactivate the account, it is recommended to save the "
"existing keys to preserve access to that data."
msgstr ""
"Deaktivace bezplatného účtu Plausible.io propojeného s vaší **Odoo Online** "
"database také odstraní existující klíče. Výsledkem bude vygenerování nových "
"klíčů, zatímco všechna historická data zůstanou spojená se starými klíči. "
"Pokud plánujete účet deaktivovat, doporučuje se uložit stávající klíče pro "
"zachování přístupu k těmto datům."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:56
msgid ""
"If your database is hosted on Odoo.sh or On-premise, you need to create your "
"own Plausible.io account or use an existing one and link it to your "
"database. To do so, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"Hvis din database er hostet på Odoo.sh eller on-premise, skal du oprette din "
"egen Plausible.io-konto eller bruge en eksisterende og knytte den til din "
"database. Følg disse trin for at gøre det:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:61
msgid ""
"`Create <https://plausible.io/register>`_ or `sign in <https://plausible.io/"
"login>`_ to a Plausible.io account."
msgstr ""
"`Opret <https://plausible.io/register>`_ eller `log ind <https://"
"plausible.io/login>`_ på en Plausible.io-konto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:63
msgid ""
"If you are creating a new account, go through the registration and "
"activation steps. On the :guilabel:`Add a website` page, enter your "
"website :guilabel:`Domain` name without including `www` or `http` (e.g., "
"`example.com`), and click :guilabel:`Add site`. On the :guilabel:`Add "
"tracking to your site` page, follow the instructions to install Plausible on "
"your site. Once done, click :guilabel:`I've installed it` to proceed to the "
"next step."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du opretter en ny konto, skal du gennemgå registrerings- og "
"aktiveringstrinnene. På siden :guilabel:`Tilføj et websted` skal du indtaste "
"dit websteds :guilabel:`Domæne`navn uden at inkludere `www` eller `http` "
"(f.eks. `example.com`), og klikke på :guilabel:`Tilføj websted`. På "
"siden :guilabel:`Tilføj sporing til dit websted` skal du følge "
"instruktionerne for at installere Plausible på dit websted. Når det er "
"gjort, skal du klikke på :guilabel:`Jeg har installeret det` for at "
"fortsætte til næste trin."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:68
msgid ""
"Once done, click the Plausible.io logo in the upper-left part of the page to "
"access the `list of websites <https://plausible.io/sites>`_, then click "
"the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`ellipsis`) icon next to the website "
"and select :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Settings`."
msgstr ""
"Når det er gjort, skal du klikke på Plausible.io-logoet i øverste venstre "
"del af siden for at få adgang til `listen over websteder <https://"
"plausible.io/sites>`_, derefter klikke på ikonet :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` "
"(:guilabel:`ellipse`) ved siden af webstedet og vælge :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`Indstillinger`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:72
msgid "Click the gear icon in the list of websites."
msgstr "Klikněte na ikonu ozubeného kola v seznamu webových stránek."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:75
msgid ""
"In the sidebar, select :guilabel:`Visibility`, then click :guilabel:`Add "
"shared link`."
msgstr ""
"V postranní liště vyberte :guilabel:`Viditelnost`, poté klikněte "
"na :guilabel:`Přidat sdílený odkaz`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:76
msgid ""
"Enter a :guilabel:`Name`, keep the :guilabel:`Password protect` option "
"disabled, as the Plausible analytics dashboard integration in Odoo does not "
"support it, then click :guilabel:`Create shared link`."
msgstr ""
"Indtast et :guilabel:`Navn`, behold "
"indstillingen :guilabel:`Adgangskodebeskyttelse` deaktiveret, da Plausible "
"analytics dashboard-integrationen i Odoo ikke understøtter den, og klik "
"derefter på :guilabel:`Opret delt link`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:79
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`fa-files-o` :guilabel:`COPY` to add the shared link to the "
"clipboard."
msgstr ""
"Klik på :icon:`fa-files-o` :guilabel:`KOPIER` for at kopiere det delte link "
"til udklipsholderen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:81
msgid "Copy the shared link URL from Plausible.io"
msgstr "Zkopírujte URL sdíleného odkazu z Plausible.io"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:84
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:127
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:175
msgid "In Odoo, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings`."
msgstr ""
"V Odoo přejděte na :menuselection:`Hjemmeside --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:85
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Tracking & SEO` section, enable :guilabel:`Plausible "
"Analytics`, then paste the :guilabel:`Shared Link Auth` and "
"click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"I afsnittet :guilabel:`Sporing & SEO` skal du aktivere :guilabel:`Plausible "
"Analytics`, derefter indsætte :guilabel:`Delt link-godkendelse` og klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Gem`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:89
msgid ""
"If you have :doc:`multiple websites <../configuration/multi_website>`, add "
"them to your Plausible.io account by going to `<https://plausible.io/"
"sites>`_ and clicking :guilabel:`+ Add Website`. In the Odoo Website "
"settings, ensure that the correct website is selected from the dropdown menu "
"at the top of the page before pasting the shared link."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du har :doc:`flere hjemmesider <../configuration/multi_website>`, skal "
"du tilføje dem til din Plausible.io-konto ved at gå til `<https://"
"plausible.io/sites>`_ og klikke på :guilabel:`+ Tilføj hjemmeside`. I Odoo "
"Hjemmeside-indstillingerne skal du sikre, at den korrekte hjemmeside er "
"valgt i rullemenuen øverst på siden, før du indsætter det delte link."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:93
msgid ""
"Odoo automatically pushes two custom goals: `Lead Generation` and `Shop`. "
"Custom goals can be added via Plausible.io. To do so, click the :icon:`fa-"
"ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`ellipsis`) button on the relevant website card, then "
"navigate to :guilabel:`Goals` in the sidebar menu, and click :guilabel:`Add "
"goal` :icon:`fa-caret-down`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo overfører automatisk to brugerdefinerede mål: `Lead Generation` og "
"`Shop`. Brugerdefinerede mål kan tilføjes via Plausible.io. For at gøre "
"dette skal du klikke på knappen :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`tre "
"prikker`) på det relevante hjemmesidekort, derefter navigere "
"til :guilabel:`Mål` i sidemenuen og klikke på :guilabel:`Tilføj "
"mål` :icon:`fa-caret-down`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:99
msgid "`Plausible Analytics documentation <https://plausible.io/docs>`_"
msgstr "`Dokumentace Plausible Analytics <https://plausible.io/docs>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:104
msgid "Google Analytics"
msgstr "Google Analytics"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:106
msgid "To follow your Odoo website's traffic with Google Analytics:"
msgstr ""
"Chcete-li sledovat provoz své Odoo hjemmesiden pomocí Google Analytics:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:108
msgid ""
"Create or sign in to a Google account using the following link: `<https://"
"analytics.google.com>`_."
msgstr ""
"Vytvořte si účet Google nebo se přihlaste pomocí následujícího odkazu: "
"`<https://analytics.google.com>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:109
msgid ""
"If you are setting up Google Analytics for the first time, "
"click :guilabel:`Start measuring` and go through the account creation step."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du konfigurerer Google Analytics for første gang, skal du klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Start måling` og gennemgå trinnet til oprettelse af konto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:111
msgid ""
"If you already have a Google Analytics account, sign in and click "
"the :icon:`fa-cog` icon in the bottom-left corner of the page to access "
"the :guilabel:`Admin` page. Then, click :icon:`fa-"
"plus` :guilabel:`Create` :icon:`fa-caret-down` and "
"select :guilabel:`Property` from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du allerede har en Google Analytics-konto, skal du logge ind og klikke "
"på ikonet :icon:`fa-cog` i nederste venstre hjørne af siden for at få adgang "
"til siden :guilabel:`Administrator`. Klik derefter på :icon:`fa-"
"plus` :guilabel:`Opret` :icon:`fa-caret-down`, og vælg :guilabel:`Ejendom` i "
"rullemenuen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:115
msgid ""
"Complete the next steps: `property creation <https://support.google.com/"
"analytics/answer/9304153?hl=en/"
"&visit_id=638278591144564289-3612494643&rd=2#property>`_, :guilabel:`Business "
"details`, and :guilabel:`Business objectives`, and click :guilabel:`Create`."
msgstr ""
"Gennemfør de næste trin: `oprettelse af ejendom <https://support.google.com/"
"analytics/answer/9304153?hl=en/"
"&visit_id=638278591144564289-3612494643&rd=2#property>`_, :guilabel:`Virksomhedsoplysninger` "
"og :guilabel:`Forretningsmål`, og klik på :guilabel:`Opret`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:117
msgid ""
"When you reach the :guilabel:`Data collection` step, choose "
"the :guilabel:`Web` platform."
msgstr ""
"Når du når til trinnet :guilabel:`Dataindsamling`, skal du vælge "
"platformen :guilabel:`Web`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:118
msgid ""
"Set up your data stream: Specify your :guilabel:`Website URL` and "
"a :guilabel:`Stream name`, then click :guilabel:`Create & continue` in the "
"upper-right corner."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurer din datastrøm: Angiv din :guilabel:`Webadresse` og "
"et :guilabel:`Navn på datastrøm`, og klik derefter på :guilabel:`Opret og "
"fortsæt` i øverste højre hjørne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:120
msgid ""
"Close the :guilabel:`Set up a Google Tag` popover, as no Google Tag is "
"required to link Google Analytics to Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Luk pop op-vinduet :guilabel:`Konfigurer et Google-tag`, da der ikke kræves "
"et Google-tag for at forbinde Google Analytics med Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:122
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Web stream details` popover, copy "
"the :guilabel:`Measurement ID`."
msgstr ""
"I pop op-vinduet :guilabel:`Oplysninger om webdatastrøm` skal du kopiere "
"dit :guilabel:`Måle-id`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:124
msgid "Measurement ID in Google Analytics."
msgstr "Måle-id i Google Analytics."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:128
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Tracking & SEO` section, enable :guilabel:`Google Tag "
"Manager/Google Analytics`, paste the measurement ID in "
"the :guilabel:`Identifier` field, and click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"I sektionen :guilabel:`Sporing & SEO` skal du aktivere :guilabel:`Google Tag "
"Manager/Google Analytics`, indsætte måle-id'et i "
"feltet :guilabel:`Identifikator` og klikke på :guilabel:`Gem`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:133
msgid ""
"If you have :doc:`multiple websites <../configuration/multi_website>` with "
"separate domains, it is recommended to create `one property <https://"
"support.google.com/analytics/answer/9304153?hl=en/"
"&visit_id=638278591144564289-3612494643&rd=2#property>`_ per domain. In "
"Odoo, in the **Website** settings, make sure to select the correct website "
"in the field next to :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`New website` at the top of "
"the page before pasting the :guilabel:`Measurement ID`."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du har :doc:`flere hjemmesider <../configuration/multi_website>` med "
"separate domæner, anbefales det at oprette `én ejendom <https://"
"support.google.com/analytics/answer/9304153?hl=en/"
"&visit_id=638278591144564289-3612494643&rd=2#property>`_ pr. domæne. I Odoo "
"skal du i indstillingerne for **Hjemmeside** sørge for at vælge den korrekte "
"hjemmeside i feltet ved siden af :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`Ny hjemmeside` "
"øverst på siden, før du indsætter dit :guilabel:`Måle-id`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:140
msgid ""
"`Google documentation on setting up Analytics for a website <https://"
"support.google.com/analytics/answer/1008015?hl=en/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Google-dokumentation om konfiguration af Analytics til en hjemmeside "
"<https://support.google.com/analytics/answer/1008015?hl=en/>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:146
msgid "Google Tag Manager"
msgstr "Google Tag Manager"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:148
msgid ""
"Google Tag Manager is a tag management system that allows you to easily "
"update measurement codes and related code fragments, collectively known as "
"tags, on your website or mobile app."
msgstr ""
"Google Tag Manager er et tagstyringssystem, der giver dig mulighed for nemt "
"at opdatere målekoder og relaterede kodefragmenter, samlet kendt som tags, "
"på din hjemmeside eller mobilapp."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:152
msgid ""
":abbr:`GTM (Google Tag Manager)` is not an analytics tool and does not offer "
"reporting features. It is used to collect data and works alongside Google "
"Analytics to provide more detailed insights. To use GTM properly, it is "
"recommended to configure Google Analytics as well."
msgstr ""
":abbr:`GTM (Google Tag Manager)` er ikke et analyseværktøj og tilbyder ikke "
"rapporteringsfunktioner. Det bruges til at indsamle data og fungerer sammen "
"med Google Analytics for at give mere detaljeret indsigt. For at bruge GTM "
"korrekt anbefales det også at konfigurere Google Analytics."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:156
msgid ""
"For more information, refer to the `documentation on linking Google "
"Analytics and Google Tag Manager <https://support.google.com/tagmanager/"
"answer/9442095?hl=en>`_."
msgstr ""
"For mere information henvises til `dokumentationen om tilknytning af Google "
"Analytics og Google Tag Manager <https://support.google.com/tagmanager/"
"answer/9442095?hl=en>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:160
msgid ""
"Some GTM tags use data layers (e.g., advanced eCommerce tracking data "
"layers) to retrieve variables and send them to Google Analytics. Data layers "
"are currently not managed in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Nogle GTM-tags bruger datalag (f.eks. avancerede webshop-sporingsdatalag) "
"til at hente variabler og sende dem til Google Analytics. Datalag håndteres "
"i øjeblikket ikke i Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:162
msgid ""
"Google Tag Manager may not be compliant with local data protection "
"regulations."
msgstr ""
"Google Tag Manager er muligvis ikke i overensstemmelse med lokale "
"databeskyttelsesregler."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:164
msgid "To configure GTM, proceed as follows:"
msgstr "For at konfigurere GTM skal du gøre følgende:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:166
msgid ""
"`Create an account and a container in Google Tag Manager <https://"
"support.google.com/tagmanager/answer/14842164?hl=en>`_."
msgstr ""
"`Opret en konto og en container i Google Tag Manager <https://"
"support.google.com/tagmanager/answer/14842164?hl=en>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:168
msgid ""
"On the `GTM accounts page <https://tagmanager.google.com/#/home>`_, locate "
"the relevant website and copy the container ID from the :guilabel:`Container "
"ID` column. The ID starts with `GTM-`, e.g., `GTM-1234XXX4321`."
msgstr ""
"Find den relevante hjemmeside på `siden med GTM-konti <https://"
"tagmanager.google.com/#/home>`_, og kopiér container-id'et fra "
"kolonnen :guilabel:`Container-id`. Id'et starter med `GTM-`, f.eks. "
"`GTM-1234XXX4321`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:172
msgid "Locate the container id."
msgstr "Find container-id'et."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:176
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Tracking & SEO` section, enable :guilabel:`Google Tag "
"Manager/Google Analytics`, paste the container ID in "
"the :guilabel:`Identifier` field, and click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"I sektionen :guilabel:`Sporing & SEO` skal du aktivere :guilabel:`Google Tag "
"Manager/Google Analytics`, indsætte container-id'et i "
"feltet :guilabel:`Identifikator` og klikke på :guilabel:`Gem`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:181
msgid ""
"Alternatively, GTM can be configured by manually inserting code snippets. To "
"do so:"
msgstr ""
"Alternativt kan GTM konfigureres ved manuelt at indsætte kodestykker. Gør "
"følgende:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:183
msgid ""
"On the `GTM accounts page <https://tagmanager.google.com/#/home>`_, click "
"the relevant website."
msgstr ""
"Klik på den relevante hjemmeside på `siden med GTM-konti <https://"
"tagmanager.google.com/#/home>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:185
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Workspace` page, click the container ID in the upper-right "
"corner."
msgstr ""
"På siden :guilabel:`Arbejdsområde` skal du klikke på container-id'et i "
"øverste højre hjørne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:186
msgid "Copy the `<head>` and `<body>` code from the pop-up window."
msgstr "Kopiér `<head>` og `<body>` koden fra pop op-vinduet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:187
msgid ""
"In Odoo, go to your website, click :guilabel:`Edit`. Then, navigate to "
"the :guilabel:`Theme` tab, scroll down to the :guilabel:`Advanced` section, "
"and, next to :guilabel:`Code Injection`, click :guilabel:`<head> and </"
"body>` to paste the corresponding code."
msgstr ""
"I Odoo skal du gå til dit websted og klikke på :guilabel:`Redigér`. Naviger "
"derefter til fanen :guilabel:`Tema`, rul ned til sektionen "
":guilabel:`Avanceret`, og klik ud for :guilabel:`Kodeinjektion` på "
":guilabel:`<head> og </body>` for at indsætte den tilsvarende kode."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:193
msgid ""
"The data is collected in the marketing tools used to monitor the website "
"(e.g., Google Analytics, Plausible, Facebook Pixel), not in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Dataene indsamles i de marketingværktøjer, der bruges til at overvåge "
"hjemmesiden (f.eks. Google Analytics, Plausible, Facebook Pixel), ikke i "
"Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/analytics.rst:197
msgid ""
"`Setting up click triggers on Google <https://support.google.com/tagmanager/"
"answer/7679320?hl=en&ref_topic=7679108&sjid=17684856364781654579-EU>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Konfiguration af klikudløsere på Google <https://support.google.com/"
"tagmanager/answer/7679320?hl=en&ref_topic=7679108&sjid=17684856364781654579-"
"EU>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:3
msgid "Link tracker"
msgstr "Linktracker"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:5
msgid ""
"The link tracker is used to create tracked links to measure the "
"effectiveness of marketing campaigns, making it easier to identify which "
"channels drive the most traffic and make more informed decisions."
msgstr ""
"Link trackeren bruges til at oprette sporede links for at måle "
"effektiviteten af marketingkampagner, hvilket gør det lettere at "
"identificere, hvilke kanaler der driver mest trafik og træffe mere "
"informerede beslutninger."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:9
msgid ""
"To create and manage tracked links, :ref:`install <general/install>` "
"the :guilabel:`Link Tracker` (`website links`) module."
msgstr ""
"For at oprette og administrere sporede links skal du :ref:`installere "
"<general/install>` modulet :guilabel:`Link Tracker` (`website links`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:15
msgid "Create traceable URLs"
msgstr "Opret sporbare URL'er"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:17
msgid ""
"To create and manage tracked links, navigate to :menuselection:`Website --> "
"Site --> Link Tracker`. Fill in the following information and "
"click :guilabel:`Generate tracked link` to create a tracking URL."
msgstr ""
"For at oprette og administrere sporede links skal du navigere "
"til :menuselection:`Hjemmeside --> Websted --> Linksporingsprogram`. Udfyld "
"følgende oplysninger og klik på :guilabel:`Generer sporet link` for at "
"oprette en sporings-URL."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:21
msgid ""
":guilabel:`URL`: The URL that is the target of the campaign. It is "
"automatically populated with the URL used to access the menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`URL`: Den URL, der er målet for kampagnen. Den udfyldes "
"automatisk med den URL, der bruges til at få adgang til menuen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:23
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Campaign`: The specific campaign the link should be associated "
"with. This parameter is used to distinguish the different campaigns."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kampagne`: Den specifikke kampagne, som linket skal knyttes til. "
"Denne parameter bruges til at skelne mellem forskellige kampagner."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:25
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Medium`: The medium describes the category or method through "
"which the visitor arrives at your site, such as organic search, paid search, "
"social media ad, email, etc."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Medie`: Mediet beskriver kategorien eller metoden, hvorigennem "
"besøgende ankommer til dit websted, såsom organisk søgning, betalt søgning, "
"annonce på sociale medier, e-mail osv."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:27
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Source`: The source identifies the specific platform or website "
"that referred the visitor, such as a search engine, newsletter, or website."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kilde`: Kilden identificerer den specifikke platform eller "
"hjemmeside, der henviste besøgende, f.eks. en søgemaskine, et nyhedsbrev "
"eller en hjemmeside."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:30
msgid "Create a link tracker URL"
msgstr "Opret en link tracker-URL"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:34
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Campaign`, :guilabel:`Medium`, and :guilabel:`Source` "
"are :abbr:`UTM (Urchin Tracking Module)` parameters incorporated in the "
"tracked URL. These can be used, for example, to customize "
"the :ref:`visibility <website/visibility/conditions>` of website building "
"blocks."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kampagne`, :guilabel:`Medie` og :guilabel:`Kilde` er :abbr:`UTM "
"(Urchin Tracking Module)`-parametre inkorporeret i den sporede URL. Disse "
"kan f.eks. bruges til at tilpasse :ref:`synligheden <website/visibility/"
"conditions>` af hjemmesidens byggeklodser."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:39
msgid "Tracked links overview"
msgstr "Oversigt over sporede links"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:41
msgid ""
"To get an overview of your tracked links, go to :menuselection:`Website --> "
"Site --> Link Tracker` and scroll down to :guilabel:`Your tracked links` "
"section."
msgstr ""
"For at få en oversigt over dine sporede links skal du gå "
"til :menuselection:`Hjemmeside --> Websted --> Link Tracker` og rulle ned "
"til afsnittet :guilabel:`Dine sporede links`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:44
msgid "Get an overview of all the links you track."
msgstr "Få en oversigt over alle de links, du sporer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:48
msgid "Statistics"
msgstr "Statistik"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/reporting/link_tracker.rst:50
msgid ""
"To measure the performance of tracked links, click the track link and scroll "
"down to the :guilabel:`Statistics` section to get an overview of the number "
"of clicks for the tracked link. By default, the graph shows the total number "
"of clicks. You can change the period to :guilabel:`Last Month` "
"or :guilabel:`Last Week` using the options on the right side of the heading."
msgstr ""
"For at måle præstationen af sporede links skal du klikke på det sporede link "
"og rulle ned til sektionen :guilabel:`Statistik` for at få et overblik over "
"antallet af klik på det sporede link. Som standard viser grafen det samlede "
"antal klik. Du kan ændre perioden til :guilabel:`Sidste måned` "
"eller :guilabel:`Sidste uge` ved hjælp af valgmulighederne på højre side af "
"overskriften."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure.rst:9
msgid ""
"Structure your website using :doc:`pages <../website/structure/pages>`, "
"provide consistent visual and navigational framework with :doc:`headers and "
"footers <../website/structure/header_footer>` and optimize your online "
"presence with :doc:`Search Engine Optimization (SEO) <../website/structure/"
"seo>`."
msgstr ""
"Strukturer dit websted ved hjælp af :doc:`sider <../website/structure/"
"pages>`, tilbyd en konsekvent visuel og navigationsramme "
"med :doc:`sidehoveder og sidefødder <../website/structure/header_footer>`, "
"og optimer din onlinetilstedeværelse med :doc:`søgemaskineoptimering (SEO) "
"<../website/structure/seo>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure.rst:15
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:5
msgid "Pages"
msgstr "Sider"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure.rst:15
msgid ""
"Create pages for your website and customize their content and appearance to "
