":guilabel:`Baggrund` og :guilabel:`Tekstfarve`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/header_footer.rst:216
msgid ""
"To hide the header on all pages, go to the :guilabel:`Theme` tab of the "
"website editor. Scroll down to the :guilabel:`Advanced` section and "
