"colors>` for visuelt at adskille rullemenuknapper i sidehovedet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/header_footer.rst:224
msgid "Define a :ref:`font <website/themes/fonts>`."
msgstr "Definer en :ref:`skrifttype <website/themes/fonts>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/header_footer.rst:225
msgid "Set the :guilabel:`Format` size and add a color if needed."
msgstr ""
"Indstil størrelsen på :guilabel:`Format`, og tilføj en farve om nødvendigt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/header_footer.rst:227
msgid ""
"To control the visibility of specific elements, navigate to "
"the :guilabel:`Show/Hide Elements` section of the :guilabel:`Style` tab and "
"click the option related to the element you wish to show or hide. You can "
