msgid ""
":guilabel:`Visuals`, such as the :guilabel:`Company logo`, :guilabel:`Text "
"Elements` (e.g., a phone number), and :guilabel:`Social Links` for linking "
"all social media accounts."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Visuelle elementer`, såsom :guilabel:`Virksomhedslogo`, "
":guilabel:`Tekstelementer` (f.eks. et telefonnummer) og :guilabel:`Sociale "
