":guilabel:`Sidehovedknap` (som standard knappen :guilabel:`Kontakt os`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/header_footer.rst:236
msgid ""
":doc:`eCommerce <../../ecommerce>`-specific elements: the :ref:`Add to cart "
