"catalog/footer>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:7
msgid ""
"Odoo allows you to :ref:`create <website/pages/page_creation>` different "
"kinds of webpages, including with the help of :ref:`AI <website/pages/ai-"
"generator>`, :ref:`publish <website/pages/un-publish-page>` them, and define "
"their structure and visibility by configuring :ref:`page properties <website/"
"pages/page_properties>`. Pages can be :ref:`duplicated <website/pages/"
"duplicate-page>`, :ref:`deleted <website/pages/delete-page>`, "
"and :ref:`redirected <website/pages/URL-redirection>`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo giver dig mulighed for at :ref:`oprette <website/pages/page_creation>` "
"forskellige slags websider, herunder med hjælp fra :ref:`KI <website/pages/"
"ai-generator>`, :ref:`publicere <website/pages/un-publish-page>` dem og "
"definere deres struktur og synlighed ved at konfigurere :ref:`sideegenskaber "
"<website/pages/page_properties>`. Sider kan :ref:`duplikeres <website/pages/"
"duplicate-page>`, :ref:`slettes <website/pages/delete-page>` "
"og :ref:`omdirigeres <website/pages/URL-redirection>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:16
msgid "Page types"
msgstr "Sidetyper"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:18
msgid ""
"**Static** pages, such as the homepage or :ref:`custom <website/pages/"
"page_creation>` pages, contain fixed content that does not change "
"dynamically. You can manually create these pages, define their URLs, and "
"adapt their :ref:`properties <website/pages/page_properties>` as needed."
msgstr ""
"**Statiske** sider, såsom hjemmesiden eller :ref:`tilpassede <website/pages/"
"page_creation>` sider, indeholder fast indhold, der ikke ændrer sig "
"dynamisk. Du kan manuelt oprette disse sider, definere deres URL'er og "
"tilpasse deres :ref:`egenskaber <website/pages/page_properties>` efter behov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/structure/pages.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Dynamic** pages, on the other hand, display content that changes "
"automatically based on the data in the database and user interaction (e.g., "
"filtering). They are generated automatically by Odoo, for example, when "
"installing an app or module (e.g., `/shop` or `/blog`) or publishing a "
"new :doc:`product <../../ecommerce>` or :doc:`blog post <../../blog>`. "
"Dynamic pages are managed differently from static pages."
msgstr ""
"**Dynamiske** sider viser derimod indhold, der ændres automatisk baseret på "
"data i databasen og brugerinteraktion (f.eks. filtrering). De genereres "
"automatisk af Odoo, f.eks. når en app eller et modul installeres (f.eks. `/"
"shop` eller `/blog`) eller når et nyt :doc:`produkt <../../ecommerce>` "
"eller :doc:`blogindlæg <../../blog>` publiceres. Dynamiske sider "
"administreres anderledes end statiske sider."

