#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:219
msgid "Shadows"
msgstr "Skygger"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:221
msgid ""
"Configure the default shadow styles used across sections, cards, and other "
"elements. To customize them, go to the :guilabel:`Shadow` section, and "
"define the :ref:`Color <website/themes/colors>`, :guilabel:`Blur`, "
"and :guilabel:`Spread` values for each shadow "
"size: :guilabel:`Normal`, :guilabel:`Small`, and :guilabel:`Large`. These "
"settings serve as the default shadow styles. Whenever you apply a shadow "
"option to a :doc:`building block <building_blocks>` or another website "
"element, the corresponding configured shadow option is automatically applied."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurer standardformaterne for skygger, der bruges på tværs af sektioner, "
"kort og andre elementer. For at tilpasse dem skal du gå til "
"sektionen :guilabel:`Skygge` og angive værdierne for :ref:`Farve <website/"
"themes/colors>`, :guilabel:`Sløring` og :guilabel:`Spredning` for hver "
"skyggestørrelse: :guilabel:`Normal`, :guilabel:`Lille` og :guilabel:`Stor`. "
"Disse indstillinger fungerer som standardformater for skygge. Hver gang du "
"anvender en skyggeindstilling på en :doc:`byggeblok <building_blocks>` eller "
"et andet element på webstedet, anvendes den tilsvarende konfigurerede "
"skyggeindstilling automatisk."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:231
msgid "Advanced settings"
msgstr "Avancerede indstillinger"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:233
msgid ""
"Additional settings can be configured in the :guilabel:`Advanced` section, "
"such as :doc:`showing or hiding the header <../structure/header_footer>` and "
"using :guilabel:`Code Injection` for :ref:`website verification through an "
"HTML tag <website/google_search_console/HTML-tag>`."
msgstr ""
"Yderligere indstillinger kan konfigureres i sektionen :guilabel:`Avanceret`, "
"såsom :doc:`at vise eller skjule sidehovedet <../structure/header_footer>` "
"og brug af :guilabel:`Code Injection` til :ref:`webstedsbekræftelse via et "
"HTML-tag <website/google_search_console/HTML-tag>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:237
msgid ""
"You can also configure Google Maps to display maps and enable geolocation "
"features on the website, e.g., on the :guilabel:`Contact Us` page and in "
"specific snippets. To configure this option:"
msgstr ""
"Du kan også konfigurere Google Maps til at vise kort og aktivere "
"geolokaliseringsfunktioner på hjemmesiden, f.eks. på "
"siden :guilabel:`Contact Us` og i specifikke snippets. For at konfigurere "
"denne indstilling:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:241
msgid ""
"Go to your `Google account <https://console.cloud.google.com/getting-"
"started>`_."
msgstr ""
"Gå til din `Google-konto <https://console.cloud.google.com/getting-"
"started>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:242
msgid ""
":ref:`Enable <address_autocomplete/enable-api>` the :guilabel:`Maps Static "
"API`, :guilabel:`Maps JavaScript API`, and :guilabel:`Places API`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Aktiver <address_autocomplete/enable-api>` :guilabel:`Maps Static "
"API`, :guilabel:`Maps JavaScript API` og :guilabel:`Places API`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:246
msgid ""
"Do not enable :guilabel:`Places API (New)`, as it is not yet supported by "
"Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Aktivér ikke :guilabel:`Places API (New)`, da det endnu ikke understøttes af "
"Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:247
msgid ""
"Using the Google APIs could require `payment to Google <https://"
"mapsplatform.google.com/pricing/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Brug af Google API'erne kan kræve `betaling til Google <https://"
"mapsplatform.google.com/pricing/>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:250
msgid ""
":ref:`Create an API key <address_autocomplete/generate_api_key>` and copy it."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Opret en API-nøgle <address_autocomplete/generate_api_key>`, og kopiér "
"den."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:251
msgid ""
"In Odoo's website editor, go to the :guilabel:`Theme` tab, and, in "
"the :guilabel:`Advanced` section, click :guilabel:`Custom Key` next "
"to :guilabel:`Google Map`."
msgstr ""
"I Odoos hjemmesideeditor skal du gå til fanen :guilabel:`Tema` og i "
"sektionen :guilabel:`Avanceret` klikke på :guilabel:`Brugerdefineret nøgle` "
"ved siden af :guilabel:`Google Map`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/themes.rst:253
msgid "Paste the generated API key into the :guilabel:`API Key` field."
msgstr "Indsæt den genererede API-nøgle i feltet :guilabel:`API-nøgle`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/visibility.rst:5
msgid ""
":doc:`Building blocks <building_blocks>` can be displayed or hidden based on "
"a visitor's :ref:`device type (mobile or desktop) <website/visibility/mobile-"
"and-computer>` or :ref:`specific conditions <website/visibility/conditions>`."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Byggeblokke <building_blocks>` kan vises eller skjules baseret på en "
"besøgendes :ref:`enhedstype (mobil eller computer) <website/visibility/"
"mobile-and-computer>` eller :ref:`specifikke betingelser <website/visibility/"
"conditions>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/visibility.rst:9
msgid ""
"To configure a building block’s visibility, open the website editor and "
"select a building block. In the :guilabel:`Style` tab, under the block's "
"customization options, go to :guilabel:`Visibility`."
msgstr ""
"For at konfigurere en byggebloks synlighed skal du åbne "
"hjemmesideredigeringen og vælge en byggeblok. På fanen :guilabel:`Stil` skal "
"du under blokkens tilpasningsmuligheder gå til :guilabel:`Synlighed`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/visibility.rst:15
msgid "Mobile/desktop"
msgstr "Mobil/desktop"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/visibility.rst:24
msgid ""
"To control the visibility of a building block based on the visitor's device "
"type:"
msgstr ""
"For at styre en byggebloks synlighed baseret på den besøgendes enhedstype:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/visibility.rst:26
msgid ""
"Click the |desktop icon| (:guilabel:`Show/Hide on Desktop`) button to hide "
"the block for visitors using a desktop or laptop computer."
msgstr ""
"Klik på knappen |desktop icon| (:guilabel:`Vis/skjul på desktop`) for at "
"skjule blokken for besøgende, der bruger en stationær eller bærbar computer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/visibility.rst:28
msgid ""
"Click the |mobile icon| (:guilabel:`Show/Hide on Mobile`) button to hide the "
"block for visitors using a mobile device."
msgstr ""
"Klik på knappen |mobile icon| (:guilabel:`Vis/skjul på mobil`) for at skjule "
"blokken for besøgende, der bruger en mobilenhed."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/visibility.rst:31
#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/visibility.rst:82
msgid "Then, click :guilabel:`Save` to apply the changes."
msgstr "Klik derefter på :guilabel:`Gem` for at anvende ændringerne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/visibility.rst:33
msgid ""
"Snippets and some :doc:`elements <elements>` within building blocks can also "
"be hidden individually. This is particularly useful for elements that are "
"too wide to display properly on smaller screens. To check whether this "
"option is available, select an element within a building block and look for "
"the :guilabel:`Visibility` option in the element's customization options."
msgstr ""
"Snippets og visse :doc:`elementer <elements>` i byggeblokke kan også skjules "
"enkeltvis. Dette er især nyttigt for elementer, der er for brede til at "
"blive vist korrekt på mindre skærme. For at kontrollere, om denne mulighed "
"er tilgængelig, skal du vælge et element i en byggeblok og kigge efter "
"indstillingen :guilabel:`Synlighed` under elementets tilpasningsmuligheder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/visibility.rst:39
msgid ""
"The red |mobile icon| (:guilabel:`Show/Hide on Mobile`) button indicates "
"that the selected image is hidden on mobile devices."
msgstr ""
"Den røde knap |mobile icon| (:guilabel:`Vis/skjul på mobil`) angiver, at det "
"valgte billede er skjult på mobile enheder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/visibility.rst:42
msgid "Example of a column element hidden on mobile devices."
msgstr "Eksempel på et kolonneelement skjult på mobile enheder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/visibility.rst:46
msgid ""
"It is also possible to :ref:`align the header menu based on the device type "
"<website/header_footer/menu-item-design>`."
msgstr ""
"Det er også muligt at :ref:`justere sidehovedmenuen baseret på enhedstypen "
"<website/header_footer/menu-item-design>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/visibility.rst:52
msgid "Conditions"
msgstr "Betingelser"

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/visibility.rst:54
msgid ""
"Set one or more conditions to control whether visitors can see "
"a :doc:`building block <building_blocks>` or :doc:`element <elements>` based "
"on their country (IP geolocation), website :ref:`language <translate/"
"language-selector>`, :ref:`UTM parameters <website/link_tracker/create-"
"urls>`, or :doc:`login status <../../ecommerce/configuration/"
"customer_accounts>`."
msgstr ""
"Angiv én eller flere betingelser for at styre, om besøgende kan se "
"en :doc:`byggeblok <building_blocks>` eller et :doc:`element <elements>` "
"baseret på deres land (IP-geoplacering), hjemmesidens :ref:`sprog <translate/"
"language-selector>`, :ref:`UTM-parametre <website/link_tracker/create-urls>` "
"eller :doc:`login-status <../../ecommerce/configuration/customer_accounts>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/websites/website/web_design/visibility.rst:60
