"ecommerce>`, :doc:`e-læringsplatform <../elearning>`, :doc:`forum <../"
"forum>` og/eller :doc:`blog <../blog>`. Du kan enten :ref:`oprette en ny "
"hjemmeside <website_creation/create>` eller :ref:`importere en eksisterende "
"<website_creation/import>`."

